  {
   "title": "New Free Playlist: 30 Songs of Gratitude to God",
   "url": "https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/article/free-playlist-songs-gratitude/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "The Gospel Coalition",
   "source_url": "https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Brett McCracken curates a playlist of 30 songs to help you practice gratitude to God—not just on Thanksgiving but every day.",
   "summary_zh": "布雷特·麦克拉肯（ Brett McCracken ）策划了一个包含30首歌曲的播放列表，以帮助您不仅在感恩节，而且每天都对上帝表示感谢。",
   "title_zh": "新的免费播放列表： 30首感谢上帝的歌曲",
   "content": "The older I get, the more convinced I am that a posture of gratitude is key to a life of joy. God’s gifts are constant and abundant—his daily provision of life and breath far more than we deserve. Being alert to the constancy of his gracious provision is the epitome of rightly ordered attention . That’s why Thanksgiving is such a great holiday. It’s at least one day dedicated to pausing and taking stock, giving our attention to the Giver of all good gifts. Being alert to the constancy of God’s gracious provision is the epitome of rightly ordered attention. But it’s a shame Thanksgiving is just one day. Because really, we should practice gratitude constantly. What if, as a start, we dedicated the whole month of November to giving thanks? What if we dedicated time each day this month to intentionally naming God’s provision and giving him thanks? To help, I created a new playlist all about giving thanks to God. The playlist has 30 songs (one for each of November’s 30 days) expressing gratitude to God for our salvation in Christ, for the many blessings of marriage and family, and for the beauty of the earth. You can access the playlist now on Spotify and Apple Music . Enjoy! Playlist Songs 1. “Thank You,” Ben Rector 2. “All Shall Be Well,” John Van Deusen 3. “For the Beauty of the Earth,” Kyle Church 4. “Thank You (Under the Redbud Tree),” Paul Zach 5. “Good to Give Thanks (Psalm 92),” Caroline Cobb, Wendell Kimbrough 6. “Thank You Jesus (Live),” Josh Baldwin 7. “Thank You, Lord,” Shane & Shane 8. “Thank You, Lord,” Jon Guerra 9. “Thank You Lord,” CalledOut Music 10. “Thank You Lord,” Jenn Johnson, Brooke Ligertwood 11. “Thank You Lord,” Chris Tomlin, Thomas Rhett, Florida Georgia Line 12. “Thank You,” Forrest Frank 13. “Thankful,” Verses 14. “I Praise You God,” Andy Squyres 15. “Gratitude,” Brandon Lake 16. “Grateful,” The Red Clay Strays 17. “Grateful Heart (Thank You Jesus),” CalledOut Music 18. “Thanksgiving (Live),” Gas Street Music 19. “My Heart Is Filled with Thankfulness,” Keith and Kristyn Getty 20. “Thanksgiving Hymn,” Allen Levi 21. “Thanks a Lot,” Lowland Hum, Paul Zach 22. “A Thousand Thank Yous,” Sarah Kroger 23. “Thank You Jesus for the Blood,” Charity Gayle 24.“Thanks Be to God,” Jon Foreman 25. “Thank God,” Leanna Crawford 26. “Thankful,” Forrest Frank 27. “Thank You, God.” Vic Lucas, Lady Audri 28. “Now Thank We All Our God,” Nathan Drake 29. “Give Thanks,” Anchor Hymns, Mission House, Jasmine Mullen 30. “Give Thanks,” Sandra McCracken",
   "content_zh": "我越老越相信 感激的姿态是快乐生活的关键 神的恩赐是常有的,是丰富的——他每天提供的生命和呼吸远远超出我们应得的范围。 提醒人们注意他的慷慨供给, 感恩节之所以如此伟大,\n我们至少要花一天时间去查查, 敬畏真主所赐的恩惠,是应当注意的。 但感恩节只是一天, 因为实际上,我们应该 不断练习感恩。 如果,作为一个开始,我们把整个11月份用于感谢呢?\n如果这个月我们每天花时间 故意点出上帝的供养并感谢他呢? 为了帮助,我创建了一个新的播放列表 关于感谢上帝。 播放列表有30首歌曲(11月30日每首一首),感谢上帝在基督中拯救了我们,感谢婚姻和家庭的多福,感谢大地的美丽.\n您可以在Spotify和Apple Music上访问播放列表。 慢慢来! 1. “谢谢”,本校长 2. “All Shall Be Well,”John Van Deusen 3. “为了地球的美丽”,凯尔教堂4。 “谢谢你(红花树下)”,Paul Zach 5. “Good to Give Thanks (Psalm 92)\",\"卡罗琳·科布(Caroline Cobb),温德尔·金布罗(Wendell Kimbrough 6. “谢谢你耶稣,乔什·鲍德温7。 “谢谢你,主啊,”Shane & Shane 8。\n\"谢谢你,主,\"乔恩·格拉 9. “谢谢主,”CallOut Music 10. (原始内容存档于2013-10-12). \" Thank you Lord,\" Jenn Johnson, Brooke Ligertwood 11. “谢谢主,”克里斯·汤姆林,托马斯·雷特,佛罗里达州乔治亚州12号线。 \"谢谢\"福瑞斯特·弗兰克 13. “谢谢”,第14项。 “我赞美你上帝”,Andy Squyres 15. (原始内容存档于2019-10-21) (英语). Gravidence,\" Brandon Lake 16. \"感恩\",\"红色克莱史特赖斯\"17.\n“感恩之心(谢谢耶稣)”,《18岁音乐》。 “感恩(生活)”,天然气街音乐19。 “我的心充满了感激之情”,Keith和Kristyn Getty 20。 “谢天谢地,”艾伦·莱维21。 (原始内容存档于2012-10-12). Thanks a Lot,\" Lowland Hum, Paul Zach 22. 萨拉克罗格23。 “感谢耶稣赐予的鲜血,” “感谢上帝”,乔恩·福尔曼25。\n“感谢上帝”,Leanna Crawford 26. “谢谢”,福雷斯特·弗兰克 27. “感谢上帝。” Vic Lucas, Lady Audri 28. “现在感谢我们所有人的上帝”,Nathan Drake 29. “谢谢”,Anchor Hymns, Mission House, Jasmine Mullen 30. “谢谢”,桑德拉·麦克拉肯",
   "image": "https://media.thegospelcoalition.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23192817/free-playlist-songs-gratitude.jpg",
