  {
   "title": "Ministry and Marriage: How to Be a Healthy Team",
   "url": "https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/podcasts/tgc-podcast/ministry-marriage-healthy-team/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "The Gospel Coalition",
   "source_url": "https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Marriages with one or both spouses employed in ministry face unique pressures, challenges, and opportunities.",
   "summary_zh": "配偶一方或双方受雇于事工的婚姻面临着独特的压力、挑战和机遇。",
   "title_zh": "事工与婚姻：如何成为一个健康的团队",
   "content": "Marriages with one or both spouses employed in ministry face unique pressures, challenges, and opportunities. Over the years, we change, our ministries change, and the pressures on us change. How can we navigate these changes in a way that draws us closer to each other instead of driving us apart? In this discussion, recorded at TGC25, Michael and Lucy Aitcheson talk with Jim and Angela Davis about their experiences of seeking to keep their marriage healthy while ministering faithfully. In This Episode 00:00 – Introduction to ministry and marriage 04:14 – Personal journeys and backgrounds 08:52 – Challenges for pastors’ wives 18:43 – Lessons learned and redos 26:20 – Threats to healthy marriages 28:53 – Avoiding isolation and burnout 34:20 – Navigating ministry failures 37:15 – Maintaining marital oneness 43:03 – Raising children in ministry SIGN UP for one of our newsletters to stay informed about TGC’s latest resources. Help The Gospel Coalition renew and unify the contemporary church in the ancient gospel: Give today . Don’t miss an episode of The Gospel Coalition Podcast : Apple Podcasts Spotify YouTube",
   "content_zh": "与受雇于部委的配偶一方或双方的婚姻面临独特的压力、挑战和机遇。 多年来,我们的变化,我们各部的变化,对我们的压力也发生了变化。 我们如何以使我们更接近而不是把我们分开的方式来引导这些变化? 在这场在TGC25上录制的讨论中,迈克尔和露西·艾克森(Lucy Aitcheson)与吉姆和安吉拉·戴维斯(Angela Davis)谈起他们试图保持婚姻健康同时忠实地处理婚姻的经历. 第00:00集 — — 介绍部会与婚姻 04:14 — — 个人旅行与背景 08:52 — — 对牧师妻子的挑战 18:43 — — 学到的教训与重写 26:20 — — 对健康婚姻的威胁 28:53 — — 避免孤立与燃烧 34:20 — — 导航部失败 37:15 — 保持婚姻独一性 43:03 — — 在部会SIGNUP中抚养孩子,以便随时了解TGC的最新资源。 帮助福音联盟在\"古代福音\"中更新并统一了当代教会:今天献出. 不要错过福音联盟的一集 Podcast: Apple Podcasts Spotify YouTube",
   "image": "https://media.thegospelcoalition.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/21133701/475.-TGC-Podcast-Thumbnail-with-Logo-16x9-1-1.png",
   "author": "Michael Aitcheson, Lucy Aitcheson, Jim Davis, Angela Davis",
   "tags": [
    "Podcast",
    "Marriage",
    "Ministry",
    "Pastor's Family"
   ],
