  {
   "title": "Introductory Volume to Systematic Theology (eBook)",
   "url": "https://www.monergism.com/blog/introductory-volume-systematic-theology-ebook",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Monergism",
   "source_url": "https://www.monergism.com/blog/feed",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "by Louis Berkhof in  ePub ,  .mobi  &  .pdf  formats This volume is a  prolegomena  for Berkhof's  SystematicTheology .  In it he defines the concept of dogmatic theology, theology, apologetics, ethics, and science. He also explains the Reformed doctrine of revelation and inspiration. It exxplains what is a theology and how should it be defined? Is theology necessary? What is the task of theology and what are the methods which it should use? What is religion? Is it possible for God to reveal him",
   "summary_zh": "由Louis Berkhof以ePub ， .mobi和.pdf格式撰写本卷是Berkhof系统神学的prolegomena。在其中，他定义了教条主义神学、神学、护教学、伦理学和科学的概念。他还解释了启示和启示的改革宗教义。它解释了什么是神学，它应该如何定义？神学是必要的吗？神学的任务是什么？它应该使用什么方法？什么是宗教？神有没有可能启示他",
   "title_zh": "系统神学导论（电子书）",
   "content": "by Louis Berkhof in ePub , .mobi & .pdf formats This volume is a prolegomena for Berkhof's SystematicTheology . In it he defines the concept of dogmatic theology, theology, apologetics, ethics, and science. He also explains the Reformed doctrine of revelation and inspiration. It exxplains what is a theology and how should it be defined? Is theology necessary? What is the task of theology and what are the methods which it should use? What is religion? Is it possible for God to reveal himself to human beings, and how? How can we know if the Bible is the Word of God? For those who are considering going to Seminary, to be pastors or simply Christians with ample knowledge of their faith, this is a good book to begin with. This is a very helpful volume in understanding the foundational matters of theology, ranging from the nature of Dogmatics, to the grounds of our knowledge of God, to the doctrines concerning scripture. Berkhof spends a fair amount of time discussing the differing theologies of Rome, Schleiermacher, Barth, etc. but he does it to show how they contrast with the true and full Christian Theology, namely the Reformed tradition. ----- TABLE OF CONTENTS Preface The Idea and History of Dogmatic Theology I. Names Applied to the Systematic Presentation of Theology",
   "content_zh": "由Louis Berkhof在ePub,.mobi &.pdf格式所编写 这卷是Berkhof系统神学的长篇小说 在其中他定义了教条神学,神学,道学,伦理学,和科学的概念. 他还解释了\"被改革了的启示和启发学说\". 它解释了什么是神学,应该如何定义? 神学有必要吗? 神学的任务是什么,它应该使用什么方法? 什么是宗教? 神能向人显出自己,而如何显出自己? 我们怎么知道圣经是上帝的话? 对于那些考虑去神学院,成为牧师或仅仅是对信仰有丰富了解的基督徒的人来说,这是一本很好的书,从一开始. 这是一本非常有帮助的书,有助于理解神学的基本问题,从道克马提斯的本性,到我们了解上帝的理由,到有关经文的学说. 伯克霍夫花相当长的时间讨论罗马,施莱尔马赫,巴特等不同的神学,但他这样做是为了表明他们如何与真实而完整的基督教神学,即改革后的传统形成对比. - - - - - - 说说看 一. 用于系统介绍神学的各种名称",
   "image": "https://www.monergism.com/thethreshold/sdg/eBook_Library_HP.jpg",
   "author": "john_hendryx",
