  {
   "title": "The Glory of Christ (eBook)",
   "url": "https://www.monergism.com/blog/glory-christ-ebook",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Monergism",
   "source_url": "https://www.monergism.com/blog/feed",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "BY JOHN OWEN IN  .EPUB ,  .MOBI  &  .PDF  FORMATS Formatted, lightly modernized and spelling corrections by Denise Kristiansson To design of the ensuing Discourse is to declare some part of that glory of our Lord Jesus Christ which is revealed in the Scripture, and proposed as the principal object of our faith, love, delight, and admiration. But, alas! after our utmost and most diligent inquiries, we must say, How little a portion is it of him that we can understand! His glory is incomprehensibl",
   "summary_zh": ".EPUB、.MOBI和.PDF格式的约翰·欧文Denise Kristiansson格式化、轻微现代化和拼写更正后续话语的设计是宣告圣经中揭示的我们主耶稣基督的荣耀的一部分，并建议将其作为我们信仰、爱、喜悦和钦佩的主要对象。但是，唉！在我们最大限度和最勤奋的询问之后，我们必须说，我们能理解他多么小的一部分！他的荣耀是不可理解的",
   "title_zh": "基督的荣耀（电子书）",
   "content": "BY JOHN OWEN IN .EPUB , .MOBI & .PDF FORMATS Formatted, lightly modernized and spelling corrections by Denise Kristiansson To design of the ensuing Discourse is to declare some part of that glory of our Lord Jesus Christ which is revealed in the Scripture, and proposed as the principal object of our faith, love, delight, and admiration. But, alas! after our utmost and most diligent inquiries, we must say, How little a portion is it of him that we can understand! His glory is incomprehensible, and his praises are unutterable. Some things an illuminated mind may conceive of it; but what we can express in comparison of what it is in itself, is even less than nothing. But as for those who have forsaken the only true guide herein, endeavouring to be wise above what is written, and to raise their contemplations by fancy and imagination above Scripture revelation (as many have done), they have darkened counsel without knowledge, uttering things which they understand not, which have no substance or spiritual food of faith in them.",
   "content_zh": "JOHN OWEN在.EPUB,.MOBI &.PDF FORMATS 格式化,轻取现代化并由 Denise Kristiansson 拼写校正 设计接下来的演讲是宣布我们主耶稣基督的荣耀的一部分,该荣耀在\"圣经\"中被揭示出来,并被提出作为我们信仰、爱、喜悦和钦佩的主要目标。 但是,对不起! 在经过我们最认真的询问之后,我们必须说,他有多少部分是我们能够理解的! 他的荣耀是无法理解的,他的赞美是不可磨灭的. 有些事情是明亮的心智所想象的,但是,与它本身相比,我们可以表达的甚至比什么都没有还要少。 至於舍弃其中唯一的向导,而努力超越天经的人,他们妄自尊大,妄想超越天经,他们妄自尊大,他们妄言自己所不知道的事,他们对于自己毫无信仰。",
   "image": "https://www.monergism.com/thethreshold/sdg/eBook_Library_HP.jpg",
   "author": "john_hendryx",
   "tags": [],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
   "flags": [],
