  {
   "title": "Radiating God’s Goodness",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/11/01/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Where were the packages? An inner-city church was having problems receiving deliveries. Although its office staff requested that online orders be dropped off inside the building, the goods were regularly left outside on the street, and some items were never received.",
   "summary_zh": "包裹在哪里？市中心的一个教堂在接收送货时遇到了问题。虽然其办公室工作人员要求将网上订单放在大楼内，但货物经常留在街上，有些物品从未收到。",
   "title_zh": "散发着神的良善",
   "content": "Where were the packages? An inner-city church was having problems receiving deliveries. Although its office staff requested that online orders be dropped off inside the building, the goods were regularly left outside on the street, and some items were never received.",
   "content_zh": "包裹在哪里？市中心的一个教堂在接收送货时遇到了问题。虽然其办公室工作人员要求将网上订单放在大楼内，但货物经常留在街上，有些物品从未收到。",
