  {
   "title": "Get Going with God",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/10/30/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "It was raining, bringing the temperature down even more. We were on a multiday hike in Nepal, and leaving the warm mountain lodge to venture into the freezing weather was getting harder each morning. “Let’s go,”",
   "summary_zh": "下雨了，温度更低了。我们在尼泊尔进行了多日徒步旅行，每天早上离开温暖的山间小屋冒险进入寒冷的天气变得越来越困难。“走吧。”",
   "title_zh": "与神同行",
   "content": "Our Daily Bread Devotionals",
   "content_zh": "我们的每日面包祈祷会",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
   "author": "Leslie Koh",
