   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
   "flags": [],
   "priority": 2,
   "fetched_at": "2026-11-10T02:32:56.123939",
   "extra": {
    "feed_type": "rss20"
   },
   "id": "a050d6186ca3464e"
  },
  {
   "title": "Hope in a Hero",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/10/29/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-08",
   "summary": "In a film about a vigilante crime-fighting hero, the protagonist seems to be waging an impossible war. Not only is his city overrun with violence and theft, but he also discovers that the police force, court system, and public officials are corrupt. He’s repeatedly tempted to give up on the city and leave.",
   "summary_zh": "在一部关于义警打击犯罪英雄的电影中，主角似乎正在发动一场不可能的战争。他的城市不仅充斥着暴力和盗窃，而且他还发现警察部队、法院系统和公职人员腐败。他一再想放弃这座城市而离开。",
   "title_zh": "英雄的希望",
   "content": "In a film about a vigilante crime-fighting hero, the protagonist seems to be waging an impossible war. Not only is his city overrun with violence and theft, but he also discovers that the police force, court system, and public officials are corrupt. He’s repeatedly tempted to give up on the city and leave.",
   "content_zh": "在一部关于义警打击犯罪英雄的电影中，主角似乎正在发动一场不可能的战争。他的城市不仅充斥着暴力和盗窃，而且他还发现警察部队、法院系统和公职人员腐败。他一再想放弃这座城市而离开。",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
   "author": "Karen Pimpo",
