   "title": "God’s Portrait of You",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/10/25/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "The British TV reality show Portrait Artist of the Year pits nine amateur painters against each other in creating portraits of a local celebrity. The images have to be completed in just four hours, which is condensed into the one-hour program. It’s fascinating to watch the cameras capture each artist’s creation slowly emerging from a blank canvas.",
   "summary_zh": "这位英国电视真人秀年度肖像艺术家让九位业余画家互相对立，为当地名人创作肖像。这些图像必须在短短四个小时内完成，并浓缩成一小时的节目。观看相机捕捉每位艺术家从空白画布上慢慢浮现的创作，令人着迷。",
   "title_zh": "上帝的肖像",
   "content": "The British TV reality show Portrait Artist of the Year pits nine amateur painters against each other in creating portraits of a local celebrity. The images have to be completed in just four hours, which is condensed into the one-hour program. It’s fascinating to watch the cameras capture each artist’s creation slowly emerging from a blank canvas.",
   "content_zh": "这位英国电视真人秀年度肖像艺术家让九位业余画家互相对立，为当地名人创作肖像。这些图像必须在短短四个小时内完成，并浓缩成一小时的节目。观看相机捕捉每位艺术家从空白画布上慢慢浮现的创作，令人着迷。",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
