   "title": "Quiet Faithfulness in Christ",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/10/24/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "At a large university, an artist painted ten stunning portraits of the men and women who keep the university running: those working in maintenance, food service, groundskeeping, and security. Moore said he wanted to paint them “in a position of power.” And that’s exactly what he did.",
   "summary_zh": "在一所大型大学，一位艺术家绘制了十幅令人惊叹的肖像，描绘了维持大学运转的男女：那些从事维护、食品服务、场地管理和安全工作的男女。摩尔说，他想把他们画成“有权势的人”。“这正是他所做的。",
   "title_zh": "安静地忠于基督",
   "content": "At a large university, an artist painted ten stunning portraits of the men and women who keep the university running: those working in maintenance, food service, groundskeeping, and security. Moore said he wanted to paint them “in a position of power.” And that’s exactly what he did.",
   "content_zh": "在一所大型大学，一位艺术家绘制了十幅令人惊叹的肖像，描绘了维持大学运转的男女：那些从事维护、食品服务、场地管理和安全工作的男女。摩尔说，他想把他们画成“有权势的人”。“这正是他所做的。",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
   "author": "Marvin Williams",
