   "title": "Carried Through",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/10/23/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-03",
   "summary": "Lillie Cunningham is 110 years old, yet she isn’t reliant on a cane or walker. She does rely on Scripture, however, which she reads every morning and night—and attends church every Sunday. When she considers her life, she states, “I just always had faith and trust in God that he was going to carry us through.”",
   "summary_zh": "Lillie Cunningham已经110岁了，但她并不依赖拐杖或助行器。然而，她确实依靠每天早上和晚上读的经文，并且每个星期天都去教堂。当她考虑自己的生活时，她说： “我一直对上帝有信心和信任，相信他会带领我们度过难关。”",
   "title_zh": "结转",
   "content": "Lillie Cunningham is 110 years old, yet she isn’t reliant on a cane or walker. She does rely on Scripture, however, which she reads every morning and night—and attends church every Sunday. When she considers her life, she states, “I just always had faith and trust in God that he was going to carry us through.”",
   "content_zh": "Lillie Cunningham已经110岁了，但她并不依赖拐杖或助行器。然而，她确实依靠每天早上和晚上读的经文，并且每个星期天都去教堂。当她考虑自己的生活时，她说： “我一直对上帝有信心和信任，相信他会带领我们度过难关。”",
