   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Following his 2020 ouster from a leading church-planting network over allegations of spiritual abuse, UK pastor Steve Timmis is now facing charges for rape. Police in South Yorkshire, United Kingdom announced October 29 that they charged Timmis, the former chief executive of Acts 29, and his wife, Janet, with eight counts of rape. The charges  Read more...   The post  Former Acts 29 CEO Charged with Rape in the UK  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "英国牧师Steve Timmis目前面临强奸指控。 英国南约克郡警方10月29日宣布,他们指控第29号法案前首席执行官蒂姆米斯和他的妻子珍妮特犯有8起强奸罪. 罪名,多读点...\n\n文章「前第29号法案」在英国被控强奸的首席执行官,",
   "title_zh": "前Acts 29首席执行官在英国被控犯有强奸罪",
   "content": "Following his 2020 ouster from a leading church-planting network over allegations of spiritual abuse, UK pastor Steve Timmis is now facing charges for rape. Police in South Yorkshire, United Kingdom announced October 29 that they charged Timmis, the former chief executive of Acts 29, and his wife, Janet, with eight counts of rape. The charges Read more... The post Former Acts 29 CEO Charged with Rape in the UK appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "英国牧师Steve Timmis目前面临强奸指控。 英国南约克郡警方10月29日宣布,他们指控第29号法案前首席执行官蒂姆米斯和他的妻子珍妮特犯有8起强奸罪. 罪名,多读点...\n\n文章「前第29号法案」在英国被控强奸的首席执行官,",
