   "title": "Latino Evangelicals Remain Vital Swing Votes in Midterm Election",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/latino-evangelicals-remain-vital-swing-votes-in-midterm-election/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "William Rodriguez has become accustomed to hearing immigration-related anguish. A retired pastor, Rodriguez is currently a superintendent with the Assemblies of God and oversees nearly 340 congregations, most of which are Spanish-speaking and based in Southern California. Rodriguez said most of the predominantly Hispanic churches in his district have seen someone from their congregation detained  Read more...   The post  Latino Evangelicals Remain Vital Swing Votes in Midterm Election  appeared ",
   "summary_zh": "威廉·罗德里格兹已经习惯于听到与移民相关的痛苦. 一位退休的牧师Rodriguez目前是上帝大会的主管,并监督近340个会众,其中多数讲西班牙语,总部设在南加利福尼亚州.\n\nRodriguez说,他所在地区大多数以西班牙人为主的教堂都见过他们的教友被拘留的人。 后拉丁福音派人士在中期选举中仍然保持重要摇摆的选票出现.",
   "title_zh": "拉丁裔福音派人士在中期选举中保持重要的摇摆选票",
   "content": "William Rodriguez has become accustomed to hearing immigration-related anguish. A retired pastor, Rodriguez is currently a superintendent with the Assemblies of God and oversees nearly 340 congregations, most of which are Spanish-speaking and based in Southern California.  Rodriguez said most of the predominantly Hispanic churches in his district have seen someone from their congregation detained Read more... The post Latino Evangelicals Remain Vital Swing Votes in Midterm Election appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "威廉·罗德里格兹已经习惯于听到与移民相关的痛苦. 一位退休的牧师Rodriguez目前是上帝大会的主管,并监督近340个会众,其中多数讲西班牙语,总部设在南加利福尼亚州.\n\nRodriguez说,他所在地区大多数以西班牙人为主的教堂都见过他们的教友被拘留的人。 在中期选举中,",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/latino-evangelicals-midterms.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Haleluya Hadero",
