  {
   "title": "The Book of Common Prayer Is Having a Moment",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/book-of-common-prayer-evangelicals-liturgy/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Musician Andrew Osenga and his family were volunteering at a Christian camp when a pipe burst and flooded their house—really, truly flooded, with the floors collapsing and water dribbling underneath the front door. “We had to move out for six months,” he remembered in a recent interview. “We lost everything we owned.” Osenga and his  Read more...   The post  The Book of Common Prayer Is Having a Moment  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "音乐家安德鲁·奥森加（ Andrew Osenga ）和他的家人在一个基督教营地做志愿者时，一根管子爆裂并淹没了他们的房子--真的，真的淹没了，地板坍塌了，前门下有水滴。“我们不得不搬出去六个月，”他在最近的一次采访中回忆道。“我们失去了我们所拥有的一切。“ Osenga和他的阅读更多……《共同祈祷之书》（ The Book of Common Prayer Is Having a Moment ）一文首次出现在《今日基督教》（ Christianity Today ）上。",
   "title_zh": "共同祈祷书正在酝酿中",
   "content": "Musician Andrew Osenga and his family were volunteering at a Christian camp when a pipe burst and flooded their house—really, truly flooded, with the floors collapsing and water dribbling underneath the front door. “We had to move out for six months,” he remembered in a recent interview. “We lost everything we owned.” Osenga and his Read more... The post The Book of Common Prayer Is Having a Moment appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "音乐家安德鲁·奥森加（ Andrew Osenga ）和他的家人在一个基督教营地做志愿者时，一根管子爆裂并淹没了他们的房子--真的，真的淹没了，地板坍塌了，前门下有水滴。“我们不得不搬出去六个月，”他在最近的一次采访中回忆道。“我们失去了我们所拥有的一切。“ Osenga和他的阅读更多……《共同祈祷之书》（ The Book of Common Prayer Is Having a Moment ）一文首次出现在《今日基督教》（ Christianity Today ）上。",
