  {
   "title": "A Manifesto for Phone-Free Church",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/manifesto-phone-free-church/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "What happens when you pull your phone out during a church service? We may not want to admit it, but I suspect that most of us know the truth: Our thoughts get interrupted, and our attention is divided. We become more attentive to our devices than to the Lord or even the Christian family gathered  Read more...   The post  A Manifesto for Phone-Free Church  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "当您在教堂礼拜期间拿出手机时会发生什么？我们可能不想承认这一点，但我怀疑我们大多数人都知道真相：我们的思想被打断，我们的注意力被分散。我们变得更加关注我们的设备，而不是主，甚至是聚集在一起的基督徒家庭。阅读更多...无电话教会的宣言首次出现在今天的基督教上。",
   "title_zh": "无电话教会宣言",
   "content": "What happens when you pull your phone out during a church service? We may not want to admit it, but I suspect that most of us know the truth: Our thoughts get interrupted, and our attention is divided. We become more attentive to our devices than to the Lord or even the Christian family gathered Read more... The post A Manifesto for Phone-Free Church appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "当您在教堂礼拜期间拿出手机时会发生什么？我们可能不想承认这一点，但我怀疑我们大多数人都知道真相：我们的思想被打断，我们的注意力被分散。我们变得更加关注我们的设备，而不是主，甚至是聚集在一起的基督徒家庭。阅读更多...无电话教会的宣言首次出现在今天的基督教上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/manifesto-for-screen-free-church.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Taylor Berglund",
   "tags": [
