  {
   "title": "‘Church History for Everyone’ Lives Up to Its Title",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/10/church-history-for-everyone-lives-up-review-john-fea/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "This piece was adapted from CT’s books newsletter. Subscribe here. Kevin DeYoung, Church History for Everyone: The Story of Christianity from the Fall of Jerusalem to the Dawn of the Reformation (Volume 1) (Crossway, 2026) Kevin DeYoung, a conservative Presbyterian pastor with a PhD in history, offers an accessible history of the Christian church from the  Read more...   The post  ‘Church History for Everyone’ Lives Up to Its Title  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "这篇文章改编自CT的书籍通讯. 在这里订阅。 Kevin De Young,\"教会历史为所有人服务:基督教从耶路撒冷沦陷到改革黎明的故事\"(第1卷) (Crossway, 2026) Kevin DeYoung是一位具有历史博士学位的保守长老会牧师,他提供了基督教会从\"阅读\"中可以访问的历史......\n\n「人人活到今天的教会历史」一文首先出现在今日基督教上。",
   "title_zh": "“人人共享的教会历史”彰显其头衔",
   "content": "This piece was adapted from CT’s books newsletter. Subscribe here. Kevin DeYoung, Church History for Everyone: The Story of Christianity from the Fall of Jerusalem to the Dawn of the Reformation (Volume 1) (Crossway, 2026) Kevin DeYoung, a conservative Presbyterian pastor with a PhD in history, offers an accessible history of the Christian church from the Read more... The post ‘Church History for Everyone’ Lives Up to Its Title appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "这篇文章改编自CT的书籍通讯. 在这里订阅。 Kevin De Young,\"教会历史为所有人服务:基督教从耶路撒冷沦陷到改革黎明的故事\"(第1卷) (Crossway, 2026) Kevin DeYoung是一位具有历史博士学位的保守长老会牧师,他提供了基督教会从\"阅读\"中可以访问的历史...... 「人人活到今天的教会历史」一文首先出现在今日基督教上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/books-column-fea-history.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Taylor Berglund",
   "tags": [
    "Book Genre",
