  {
   "title": "Race, Justice, and the Way Forward",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/10/race-justice-and-the-way-forward/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "God values justice. But how should Christians think about the principle when it comes to America’s racial history and our current social ills? In this video from CT’s Big Tent convening in Oakland, California, Malcolm Foley and Delano Squires sat down with Sho Baraka to discuss race, greed, accountability, mercy, and how Christians should seek  Read more...   The post  Race, Justice, and the Way Forward  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "上帝看重正义，但当涉及到美国的种族历史和我们目前的社会弊病时，基督徒应该如何看待这一原则？在CT在加利福尼亚州奥克兰召开的大帐篷会议的视频中， Malcolm Foley和Delano Squires与Sho Baraka坐下来讨论种族、贪婪、问责制、怜悯以及基督徒应该如何寻求阅读更多...后种族、正义和前进之路首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "种族、正义和前进之路",
   "content": "God values justice. But how should Christians think about the principle when it comes to America’s racial history and our current social ills? In this video from CT’s Big Tent convening in Oakland, California, Malcolm Foley and Delano Squires sat down with Sho Baraka to discuss race, greed, accountability, mercy, and how Christians should seek Read more... The post Race, Justice, and the Way Forward appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "上帝看重正义，但当涉及到美国的种族历史和我们目前的社会弊病时，基督徒应该如何看待这一原则？在CT在加利福尼亚州奥克兰召开的大帐篷会议的视频中， Malcolm Foley和Delano Squires与Sho Baraka坐下来讨论种族、贪婪、问责制、怜悯以及基督徒应该如何寻求阅读更多...后种族、正义和前进之路首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/big-tent-panel-squires-foley.jpg?resize=1200,628",
