   "title": "Reader Responses to ‘What We Know—and Cannot Know—About Elisabeth Elliot’s Sexuality’",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/10/reader-responses-elisabeth-elliot-lucy-austen/",
   "category": "devotional",
