   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "Since its publication earlier this month, Lucy S. R. Austen’s “What We Know—and Cannot Know—About Elisabeth Elliot’s Sexuality” has provoked many letters to the editor and comments on social media platforms, including substantial dialogue on Substack. We’re offering a small selection of those letters and Substack comments, lightly edited for concision and clarity, to give  Read more...   The post  Reader Responses to ‘What We Know—and Cannot Know—About Elisabeth Elliot’s Sexuality’  appeared fir",
   "summary_zh": "自本月初发表后, Lucy S. R. Austen的\"关于伊丽莎白·艾略特的性情的我们所知道的-不可知\"引发了多封信给编辑,并在社交媒体平台上发表评论,包括关于Substack的实质性对话. 这些信件和Substack的评论, 稍作编辑, 关于伊丽莎白·艾略特的性爱,",
   "title_zh": "读者对“关于伊丽莎白·埃利奥特的性取向，我们所知道和不能知道的”的回应",
   "content": "Since its publication earlier this month, Lucy S. R. Austen’s “What We Know—and Cannot Know—About Elisabeth Elliot’s Sexuality” has provoked many letters to the editor and comments on social media platforms, including substantial dialogue on Substack. We’re offering a small selection of those letters and Substack comments, lightly edited for concision and clarity, to give Read more... The post Reader Responses to ‘What We Know—and Cannot Know—About Elisabeth Elliot’s Sexuality’ appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "自本月初发表后, Lucy S. R. Austen的\"关于伊丽莎白·艾略特的性情的我们所知道的-不可知\"引发了多封信给编辑,并在社交媒体平台上发表评论,包括关于Substack的实质性对话. 这些信件和Substack的评论, 稍作编辑, 关于伊丽莎白·艾略特的性爱,",
