   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "College student Ryan Cass woke up on a college-football Saturday feeling lucky. He put together a 15-part parlay and hoped that every component of the bet would hit. Off he went to the parking lot of Kyle Field. From a Texas A&M tailgate, he watched sections of his parlay play out in other stadiums around  Read more...   The post  A College-Town Bar as Hushed as a Church  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "大学生Ryan Cass星期六在大学橄榄球比赛中醒来，感觉自己很幸运。他组建了一个由15个部分组成的游戏，并希望赌注的每个部分都能成功。他走到凯尔菲尔德的停车场。在德克萨斯州的农工大学后挡板上，他观看了他的部分戏剧在周围的其他体育场上演。阅读更多……《今日基督教》（ Christianity Today ）上首次出现了一篇名为《A College-Town Bar as Hushed as a Church》的文章。",
   "title_zh": "像教堂一样安静的大学城酒吧",
   "content": "College student Ryan Cass woke up on a college-football Saturday feeling lucky. He put together a 15-part parlay and hoped that every component of the bet would hit. Off he went to the parking lot of Kyle Field. From a Texas A&M tailgate, he watched sections of his parlay play out in other stadiums around Read more... The post A College-Town Bar as Hushed as a Church appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "大学生Ryan Cass星期六在大学橄榄球比赛中醒来，感觉自己很幸运。他组建了一个由15个部分组成的游戏，并希望赌注的每个部分都能成功。他走到凯尔菲尔德的停车场。在德克萨斯州的农工大学后挡板上，他观看了他的部分戏剧在周围的其他体育场上演。阅读更多……《今日基督教》（ Christianity Today ）上首次出现了一篇名为《A College-Town Bar as Hushed as a Church》的文章。",
