   "title": "God’s Sovereignty Knows No Political Bounds",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/10/gods-sovereignty-knows-no-political-bounds-nt-wright/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-03",
   "summary": "As often in great music, just when things seem to be reaching a peak, there’s a new chord, or a sudden modulation, which disrupts what we expect. Or perhaps instruments we haven’t heard up to this point suddenly blare out a shocking new variation on the earlier themes. What’s the composer up to? How’s it  Read more...   The post  God’s Sovereignty Knows No Political Bounds  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "就像在伟大的音乐中一样，当事情似乎达到顶峰时，就会有一个新的和弦，或突然的调制，打乱了我们的预期。或者我们到目前为止还没有听过的乐器突然在早期的主题上发现了一个令人震惊的新变化。作曲家在做什么？它是如何阅读更多...神的主权知道没有政治界限的帖子首先出现在今天的基督教中。",
   "title_zh": "神的主权无政治界限",
   "content": "As often in great music, just when things seem to be reaching a peak, there’s a new chord, or a sudden modulation, which disrupts what we expect. Or perhaps instruments we haven’t heard up to this point suddenly blare out a shocking new variation on the earlier themes. What’s the composer up to? How’s it Read more... The post God’s Sovereignty Knows No Political Bounds appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "就像在伟大的音乐中一样，当事情似乎达到顶峰时，就会有一个新的和弦，或突然的调制，打乱了我们的预期。或者我们到目前为止还没有听过的乐器突然在早期的主题上发现了一个令人震惊的新变化。作曲家在做什么？它是如何阅读更多...神的主权知道没有政治界限的帖子首先出现在今天的基督教中。",
