   "title": "Souls to the Gerrymandered Polls",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/10/black-church-midterms-souls-to-the-gerrymandered-polls/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-03",
   "summary": "When Tennessee redistricted its Nashville metropolitan area and split Shelby County, home to majority-Black Memphis, into three congressional districts earlier this year, Jefferson Street Missionary Baptist Church knew the changes would affect its congregants. Located in Nashville, the predominately Black church hosts year-round courses that teach congregants about voting and civics. Community organizations teach weekday  Read more...   The post  Souls to the Gerrymandered Polls  appeared first ",
   "summary_zh": "当田纳西州重新划出其纳什维尔都会区,并将大多数聚居地-黑孟菲斯的谢尔比县拆分为三个国会区后,杰斐逊街传教士浸信会教会知道这些变化会影响其会众. 位于纳什维尔,主要为黑人教会举办全年课程,教授集会者投票和公民知识。 社团组织教周一 读更多... 给格里曼德·波尔的\"灵魂\" 第一次出现",
   "title_zh": "Gerrymandered民意调查的灵魂",
   "content": "When Tennessee redistricted its Nashville metropolitan area and split Shelby County, home to majority-Black Memphis, into three congressional districts earlier this year, Jefferson Street Missionary Baptist Church knew the changes would affect its congregants. Located in Nashville, the predominately Black church hosts year-round courses that teach congregants about voting and civics. Community organizations teach weekday Read more... The post Souls to the Gerrymandered Polls appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "当田纳西州重新划出其纳什维尔都会区,并将大多数聚居地-黑孟菲斯的谢尔比县拆分为三个国会区后,杰斐逊街传教士浸信会教会知道这些变化会影响其会众. 位于纳什维尔,主要为黑人教会举办全年课程,教授集会者投票和公民知识。 社团组织教周一 读更多... 在今日基督教上,",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/black-church-midterms.jpg?resize=1200,628",
