   "summary": "Every preacher knows the terror of a blank screen. It is Tuesday morning—or even worse, Saturday afternoon—and the preacher sits and stares at his laptop. He has opened a new document in his word processor, and now the cursor stands idling on the page, patiently blinking. And the words aren’t coming. Let us assume that […]",
   "summary_zh": "每个传教士都知道空白屏幕的恐怖。现在是星期二早上，甚至更糟糕的是星期六下午，牧师坐在那里盯着他的笔记本电脑。他在文字处理器中打开了一个新文档，现在光标在页面上闲置，耐心地闪烁。言语不会到来。让我们假设[…]",
   "title_zh": "在段落中讲道",
   "content": "Every preacher knows the terror of a blank screen. It is Tuesday morning—or even worse, Saturday afternoon—and the preacher sits and stares at his laptop. He has opened a new document in his word processor, and now the cursor stands idling on the page, patiently blinking. And the words aren’t coming. Let us assume that […]",
