   "title": "Calvin on Work: What a Sixteenth-Century Theology of Labor Can Teach Us Today",
   "url": "https://reformation21.org/calvin-on-work-what-a-sixteenth-century-theology-of-labor-can-teach-us-today/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Reformation21",
   "source_url": "https://reformation21.org/feed",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "“To work is to survive, not live,” many today will say. In modern popular culture, this complaint is often directed at something specific, namely, the “Protestant work ethic.” Max Weber’s The Protestant Ethic and the Spirit of Capitalism (1905) drew a direct line from sixteenth-century Reformed theology to modern free-market Capitalism—which has been blamed for […]",
   "summary_zh": "“工作是为了生存，而不是生活，”今天的许多人会说。在现代流行文化中，这种抱怨通常针对某种特定的东西，即“新教徒的职业道德。马克斯·韦伯（ Max Weber ）的《新教伦理与资本主义精神》（ The Protestant Ethic and the Spirit of Capitalism ， 1905年）将16世纪改革宗神学与现代自由市场资本主义（ Modern Free-market Capitalism ）直接联系起来，后者被指责为[…]",
   "title_zh": "加尔文论工作： 16世纪的劳动神学今天能教给我们什么",
   "content": "“To work is to survive, not live,” many today will say. In modern popular culture, this complaint is often directed at something specific, namely, the “Protestant work ethic.” Max Weber’s The Protestant Ethic and the Spirit of Capitalism (1905) drew a direct line from sixteenth-century Reformed theology to modern free-market Capitalism—which has been blamed for […]",
   "content_zh": "“工作是为了生存，而不是生活，”今天的许多人会说。在现代流行文化中，这种抱怨通常针对某种特定的东西，即“新教徒的职业道德。马克斯·韦伯（ Max Weber ）的《新教伦理与资本主义精神》（ The Protestant Ethic and the Spirit of Capitalism ， 1905年）将16世纪改革宗神学与现代自由市场资本主义（ Modern Free-market Capitalism ）直接联系起来，后者被指责为[…]",
