   "summary": "Our church is swimming with babies right now. Most of our parents with young children are paedobaptists, but some are still anti-paedobaptists. Nonetheless, we welcome them as members and not only love them but love how they love and raise their children, even if they are inconsistent. The question of paedobaptism sometimes goes astray […]",
   "summary_zh": "我们的教堂现在正在和婴儿一起游泳。我们大多数有年幼孩子的父母都是恋童癖者，但有些人仍然是反恋童癖者。尽管如此，我们欢迎他们成为会员，不仅爱他们，而且爱他们如何爱和抚养他们的孩子，即使他们不一致。恋童癖洗礼的问题有时会误入歧途[…]",
   "title_zh": "恋童癖洗礼：相反的可能性",
