   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "“I don’t know who I can tell.” Those words can accompany many kinds of suffering. A marriage is falling apart. A child walks away from the faith. A family learns that someone they love is struggling with serious mental illness. A devastating diagnosis arrives. A spouse is battling an addiction. A parent is estranged from […]",
   "summary_zh": "“我不知道我能告诉谁。“这些话可以带来很多痛苦。婚姻正在分崩离析。一个孩子背弃了信仰。一个家庭得知他们所爱的人正在与严重的精神疾病作斗争。一个毁灭性的诊断即将到来。配偶正在与成瘾作斗争。父母与[…]疏远",
