  {
   "title": "Psalm 3: Sleep Well, God Will Protect You",
   "url": "https://reformation21.org/psalm-3-sleep-well-god-will-protect-you/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Reformation21",
   "source_url": "https://reformation21.org/feed",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "God Is Our Refuge and Strength: 150 Devotionals Through the Psalms, by Bill Boekestein and Rob Ventura, Published by The Banner of Truth, October 2026 Sometimes we feel like almost everyone is against us. Often that’s inaccurate. But David isn’t exaggerating: ‘Many are my foes … Many are rising against me … many’ are saying […]",
   "summary_zh": "上帝是我们的避难所和力量：通过诗篇的150篇祈祷文，由Bill Boekestein和Rob Ventura撰写，由The Banner of Truth出版， 2026年10月，有时我们觉得几乎每个人都反对我们。这通常是不准确的。但大卫并不夸张： “许多人是我的敌人……许多人起来反对我……许多人”都在说[…]",
   "title_zh": "诗篇3 ：睡个好觉，神会保护你",
   "content": "God Is Our Refuge and Strength: 150 Devotionals Through the Psalms, by Bill Boekestein and Rob Ventura, Published by The Banner of Truth, October 2026 Sometimes we feel like almost everyone is against us. Often that’s inaccurate. But David isn’t exaggerating: ‘Many are my foes … Many are rising against me … many’ are saying […]",
   "content_zh": "上帝是我们的避难所和力量：通过诗篇的150篇祈祷文，由Bill Boekestein和Rob Ventura撰写，由The Banner of Truth出版， 2026年10月，有时我们觉得几乎每个人都反对我们。这通常是不准确的。但大卫并不夸张： “许多人是我的敌人……许多人起来反对我……许多人”都在说[…]",
