   "title": "Why We Need a Proper Educational Anthropology",
   "url": "https://cbmw.org/2026/06/26/why-we-need-a-proper-educational-anthropology/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "CBMW",
   "source_url": "https://cbmw.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "When a group of Pharisees, hoping to trap Jesus into incriminating himself, ask him whether a marriage can be lawfully dissolved, Jesus refuses to take the bait. Rather than haggle with them over the legality or illegality of their first-century version of no-fault divorce, Jesus takes them back to Genesis 1–2, which establishes the biblical-anthropological […]",
   "summary_zh": "当一群法利赛人希望陷害耶稣认罪时，问他是否可以合法解除婚姻时，耶稣拒绝接受诱饵。耶稣没有就他们第一世纪版本的无过错离婚的合法性或非法性与他们讨价还价，而是将他们带回创世记1–2章，其中确立了圣经-人类学[…]",
   "title_zh": "为什么我们需要适当的教育人类学",
   "content": "When a group of Pharisees, hoping to trap Jesus into incriminating himself, ask him whether a marriage can be lawfully dissolved, Jesus refuses to take the bait. Rather than haggle with them over the legality or illegality of their first-century version of no-fault divorce, Jesus takes them back to Genesis 1–2, which establishes the biblical-anthropological […]",
   "content_zh": "当一群法利赛人希望陷害耶稣认罪时，问他是否可以合法解除婚姻时，耶稣拒绝接受诱饵。耶稣没有就他们第一世纪版本的无过错离婚的合法性或非法性与他们讨价还价，而是将他们带回创世记1–2章，其中确立了圣经-人类学[…]",
   "image": "https://cbmw.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/gdqnsmbhkus.jpg",
   "author": "Louis Markos",
