   "title": "On Being a Theologian and Teacher",
   "url": "https://cbmw.org/2026/06/26/on-being-a-theologian-and-teacher/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "CBMW",
   "source_url": "https://cbmw.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "It is a bit intimidating or challenging to be asked to write an essay on the vocation of being a theologian or teacher. Am I really a “theologian”? I find it easier to accept the title “teacher,” but “theologian”? On paper it would seem I am a theologian. I am nearing the 30-year mark of […]",
   "summary_zh": "被要求撰写一篇关于神学家或教师职业的文章有点令人生畏或具有挑战性。我真的是“神学家”吗？我觉得接受“老师”这个头衔更容易，但“神学家”呢？从纸面上看，我似乎是一名神学家。我即将迎来30年的[…]",
   "title_zh": "成为一名神学家和教师",
   "content": "It is a bit intimidating or challenging to be asked to write an essay on the vocation of being a theologian or teacher. Am I really a “theologian”? I find it easier to accept the title “teacher,” but “theologian”? On paper it would seem I am a theologian. I am nearing the 30-year mark of […]",
   "content_zh": "被要求撰写一篇关于神学家或教师职业的文章有点令人生畏或具有挑战性。我真的是“神学家”吗？我觉得接受“老师”这个头衔更容易，但“神学家”呢？从纸面上看，我似乎是一名神学家。我即将迎来30年的[…]",
