  {
   "title": "From the Archives | True Worship and the Idolatry of Works in the Christian Life",
   "url": "https://cbmw.org/2026/06/26/from-the-archives-true-worship-and-the-idolatry-of-works-in-the-christian-life/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "CBMW",
   "source_url": "https://cbmw.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Martin Luther The Christian life is lived by faith in the Son of God, who gave his life as a ransom to free those in bondage to sin and to give them everlasting life — a pure gift of God, without any human effort. The sinful human heart, however, looks elsewhere to find comfort […]",
   "summary_zh": "马丁·路德基督徒的生活是靠对神儿子的信仰而活的，他献出了自己的生命作为赎价，以释放那些被罪捆绑的人，并赐给他们永生--这是神的纯粹礼物，没有任何人为的努力。然而，罪孽深重的人心却从别处寻找安慰[…]",
   "title_zh": "档案|真正的敬拜和基督徒生活中作品的偶像崇拜",
   "content": "Martin Luther The Christian life is lived by faith in the Son of God, who gave his life as a ransom to free those in bondage to sin and to give them everlasting life — a pure gift of God, without any human effort. The sinful human heart, however, looks elsewhere to find comfort […]",
   "content_zh": "马丁·路德基督徒的生活是靠对神儿子的信仰而活的，他献出了自己的生命作为赎价，以释放那些被罪捆绑的人，并赐给他们永生--这是神的纯粹礼物，没有任何人为的努力。然而，罪孽深重的人心却从别处寻找安慰[…]",
   "image": "https://cbmw.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/zwzeorqpepo.jpg",
   "author": "Jason Lane",
   "tags": [
    "Articles",
    "Martin Luther",
    "True Worship"
   ],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
   "flags": [],
   "priority": 2,
   "fetched_at": "2026-11-11T00:26:02.631703",
   "extra": {
    "feed_type": "rss20"
   },
   "id": "656107f8508411bd"
  },
  {
   "title": "Martin Luther’s Reform of the Christian Life: A Reflection on the Doctrine of Vocation | Ancient Paths",
   "url": "https://cbmw.org/2026/06/26/martin-luthers-reform-of-the-christian-life-a-reflection-on-the-doctrine-of-vocation-ancient-paths/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "CBMW",
   "source_url": "https://cbmw.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "The late medieval church of the West taught that man had a natural capacity to become righteous with the help of divine grace. According to the teaching of Gabriel Biel (1420–1495), for example, man must simply do what is within himself (facere quod in se est), that is, he must draw on his own natural […]",
   "summary_zh": "中世纪晚期的西方教会教导说，人天生有能力在神圣恩典的帮助下成为义人。例如，根据加布里埃尔·比尔（ Gabriel Biel ） （ 1420-1495 ）的教导，人必须简单地做自己内在的事情（ facere quod in se est ） ，也就是说，他必须利用自己的自然[…]",
   "title_zh": "马丁·路德的基督徒生活改革：对职业教义的反思|古代道路",
   "content": "The late medieval church of the West taught that man had a natural capacity to become righteous with the help of divine grace. According to the teaching of Gabriel Biel (1420–1495), for example, man must simply do what is within himself (facere quod in se est), that is, he must draw on his own natural […]",
   "content_zh": "中世纪晚期的西方教会教导说，人天生有能力在神圣恩典的帮助下成为义人。例如，根据加布里埃尔·比尔（ Gabriel Biel ） （ 1420-1495 ）的教导，人必须简单地做自己内在的事情（ facere quod in se est ） ，也就是说，他必须利用自己的自然[…]",
