  {
   "title": "Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier Ministries)",
   "url": "https://www.challies.com/giveaways/free-stuff-fridays-ligonier-ministries-12/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Tim Challies",
   "source_url": "https://www.challies.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Free Stuff Fridays: Win one of 10 hardcover of The Bondage of the Will! See Also Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier Ministries) Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier Ministries) Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier)",
   "summary_zh": "周五免费赠品：赢取《意志的束缚》10本精装本之一！另请参阅免费物品周五（ Ligonier Ministries ）免费物品周五（ Ligonier Ministries ）免费物品周五（ Ligonier Ministries ）",
   "title_zh": "周五免费赠品（ Ligonier Ministries ）",
   "content": "This week’s Free Stuff Friday is sponsored by Ligonier Ministries , who also sponsored the blog this week. These days, Martin Luther is known as the man who stood against popes and emperors in defense of the gospel. What drove this lone German monk to defy the Roman Catholic Church? Today, Ligonier Ministries is offering R.C. Sproul’s Luther and the Reformation as a free download for Challies readers. In this ebook, Dr. Sproul surveys several crisis moments in the life of Martin Luther, showing how they ultimately led to his rediscovery of the gospel revealed in Scripture. With this download, you’ll also enter to win one of ten hardcover copies of Ligonier’s 500th-anniversary edition of The Bondage of the Will , Luther’s classic book defending humanity’s absolute need for God’s sovereign grace in salvation. Learn more about Luther and the Reformation here . After downloading your free ebook , you can access it in the new Grow app. See Also Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier Ministries) Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier Ministries) Free Stuff Fridays (Ligonier)",
   "content_zh": "也赞助了本周的博客。 这些天,马丁·路德被人们称为\"为捍卫福音而反抗教皇和皇帝\"的人. 是什么驱使这个孤独的德国和尚藐视罗马天主教会? 如今,利戈尼耶各部正在提供R.C.Sproul的\"路德\"和\"改革\"作为Challies读者的免费下载. 在这本电子书中,斯普鲁尔博士调查了马丁·路德生活中的几个危机时刻,展示了他们最终如何导致他重新发现圣经所揭示的福音. 通过下载,你还将获得利戈尼耶500周年纪念版《意志之誓》的10个硬拷贝之一。 路德的经典著作捍卫了人类对上帝在拯救中的主权恩典的绝对需要。 更多了解路德和改革 在下载免费电子书后,您可以在新的Grow app中访问. 另见Free Stuff Fridays(利戈尼耶各部) Free Stuff Fridays(利戈尼耶各部) Free Stuff Fridays(利戈尼耶各部) Friod Stuff Fridays (利戈尼耶各部) Friot Suff Fridays (利戈尼耶各部) Friff Frienders (利戈尼耶各部) Friff Fridays (利戈尼耶各部) Free Stuff Friends (利戈尼耶) Friff (利戈尼耶各部) Friff Friff Fridges.",
   "image": "https://www.challies.com/media/2026/10/1920x1080_AD_Reformation_Week_26_Promotion_LUT08BDBON05BH.jpg",
