   "title": "A La Carte (October 28)",
   "url": "https://www.challies.com/a-la-carte/a-la-carte-october-28-2026/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Tim Challies",
   "source_url": "https://www.challies.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-03",
   "summary": "3 Reasons why Christians should lay \"R.I.P.\" to rest / Goodbye, 'Sam's Club' megachurch. Hello, stained glass. / Beauty demands to be noticed / Aslan Sane: the Bowiefication of Narnia / Aslan and the Christians who can't be enchanted / The day of pioneer missions is not over / Kindle deals, videos, and more See Also A La Carte (October 8) A La Carte (June 25) A La Carte (April 7)",
   "summary_zh": "基督徒应该放下“R.I.P.”休息/再见的3个原因， “山姆俱乐部”大教堂。您好，彩色玻璃。/美丽要求被注意到/Aslan Sane ：纳尼亚的Bowiefication/Aslan和无法被迷住的基督徒/开拓者任务的日子还没有结束/Kindle优惠、视频等另请参阅单点（ 10月8日）单点（ 6月25日）单点（ 4月7日）",
   "title_zh": "点菜（ 10月28日）",
   "content": "Good morning. May the Lord be with you and bless you today, my friends. Sales & Deals Today’s Kindle deals include lots of good books from New Growth Press and other publishers. Among them you’ll find several good options from Jared Wilson. Recommended Reading Goodbye, ‘Sam’s Club’ Megachurch. Hello, Stained Glass. Christianity Today reports on what I consider a welcome trend: church buildings that look like churches instead of warehouses. It begins this way: “Trinity Presbyterian finally has a church building of its own. That building has arches. And carved hammerbeams that tell the story of the Bible.” 3 Reasons Why Christians Should Lay “R.I.P.” to Rest. Nick Batzig thinks it would be best for Christians to lay R.I.P. to rest. “I’ve noticed something of a concerning trend over the past several years. It is the way in which believers speak about culture-impacting individuals at their deaths. Instead of simply expressing appreciation for their life and achievements, it has become commonplace for Christians to use the shorthand ‘R.I.P.’ (rest in peace) on social media when speaking of individuals in whose lives there was no evidence of saving grace at their death. At the risk of sounding ill-tempered, I wish to set out several reasons why I am troubled by this occurrence.” Go Deeper with Ligonier’s Grow App. Looking to put down roots in God’s Word? The Grow app from Ligonier Ministries gives you clear Bible teaching and guides your daily study for a deeper walk with Christ. Ministry Partners can also access the verse-by-verse notes from the Reformation Study Bible directly in the app and get reliable answers to their theological questions with the Ask Ligonier intelligent assistant. Not a Ligonier Ministry Partner yet? Try these features for 30 days when you download Grow and sign in. (Sponsored) Beauty Demands to Be Noticed. Michael Jensen is right: beauty demands to be noticed. He tells about people who understand the connection between beauty and transcendence and says, “Clearly, the reductive and polemical explanation of the atheists isn’t proving to be compelling. People can’t square their deeply felt experience of the world with that. To the people I’ve been speaking with, at least, the world simply cannot be reduced to its material components, nor can its coherence be explained by resorting to chance.” Aslan Sane: The Bowiefication of Narnia. I’ve got a pair of articles to share that comment on the forthcoming Narnia movies, each taking a different perspective. In the first, the writer remembers the old Narnia series from her childhood and bridges from there to what we know of the new one. She’s not impressed with it. Aslan and the Christians Who Can’t Be Enchanted. In the second, the author rebukes people like me (and the previous author) who have expressed concerns. He reminds us that it’s a movie for kids and that we don’t really know much about it yet. (I’d say he writes with some degree of exaggeration when he accuses me of losing my mind, but I’m glad to consider what he says nonetheless.) The Day of Pioneer Missions Is Not Over. Writing for Desiring God, my friend Tim Keesee wants us to know that the day of pioneer missions is not over. “Pioneer missionaries are still needed today because there are vast territories and high-rise megacities where the gospel message has yet to reach.” Videos Worth Watching Here are several brief videos that are worth your time. 5 Signs Your Church Might Be Too Seeker Sensitive. Adriel Sanchez explains seeker sensitivity and offers signs your church might lean too much in that direction and become seeker driven. How to Leave a Church Well. Hershael York speaks specifically to pastors to explain how and when to leave a church well. The Enduring Word. This short film from Crossway celebrates God’s providence through the history of Bible translation. Flashback What’s The Point Of Family Devotions? There are many activities families can and will do together. But by establishing family d",
   "content_zh": "早上好,你好吗? 愿主与你同在,今天祝福你,我的朋友们. 销售与交易今日的Kindle交易包括许多来自新增长出版社和其他出版商的好书. 将会从Jared Wilson那里找到几个很好的选择。 校对:Soup 你好,污点玻璃。 今天的基督教会报道了我所认为的令人欢迎的趋势:教堂建筑看起来像教堂而不是仓库. 它是这样开始的:“长老会终于拥有自己的教堂建筑。 那栋楼有拱门 并雕刻出讲述圣经故事的锤子。 3 基督教徒为什么应该用“R.I.P. ”来安息。 尼克·巴特齐格认为基督徒最好让R. I. P. 休息. \" 我注意到过去几年来的趋势。 这是信徒谈论文化影响个人死亡的方式。 基督徒用简写\"R. I. P.\"(和平时期的缩写)在社交媒体上谈论那些生命中没有证据表明在死亡时可以省取恩惠的个人时, 冒着发泄不良情绪的风险,我想提出若干理由,说明为何我对这一事件感到不安。” Go Deeper with Ligonier's Grow App. 寻找在上帝的言语下扎根? 来自利戈尼耶各部的\"成长应用\"(Grow app)为您提供了明确的\"圣经\"教诲并指导您每天的学习与基督一起更深入地行走. Ministry Partners也可以直接从应用中取取取Reformation Research Bible的逐个音符,并与Ask Ligonier智能助手获得对其神学问题的可靠答案. 还没有Ligonier部的合伙人吗? 下载Grow并签名后,尝试这些功能30天. (赞助)美人要求被注意. 迈克尔·詹森(Michael Jensen)说得对:美的要求需要被注意. 他讲述了那些理解美丽和超越之间的联系的人,并说,“显然,无神论者所持的退缩和争辩的解释并不是令人信服的。 人们无法用这个来解释自己对世界的深刻感受。 至少不能把世界缩小为物质部分, 也不能用机会来解释世界的一致性。 阿斯兰·萨内:纳尼亚的鲍伊菲克特. 我有一对关于即将到来的纳尼亚电影的评论文章, 在第一作中,编剧回忆起从她童年到桥梁的\"纳尼亚\"(Narnia)老系列,从那里到我们对新作的了解. 她对此没有印象。 阿斯兰与基督徒, 第二起,作者斥责像我这样的人(和前一位作者),他们表达了关切. 他提醒我们这是一部给孩子们看的电影, 他指责我失去理智, 先锋任务日还没结束 我的朋友Tim Keesee希望我们知道 开拓性任务的日子还没有结束 “今天仍然需要皮奥内尔传教士,因为还有大片领土和高层特大城市,福音信息尚未传达。” 值得观看的视频 这是几段简短的视频,值得你花时间。 5 表示你的教会可能太敏感了 阿德里尔·桑切斯解释了寻找者的敏感性 并给出了你的教堂可能向那个方向倾斜太多 并成为寻求者的驱动力的迹象 如何离开教会。 Hershael York专门向牧师解释如何和何时离开教堂井。 永行之说. Crossway的这部短片通过圣经翻译的历史来庆祝上帝的降临. 回想一下家庭思维的要点是什么? 家庭可以并将一起开展许多活动。 但是通过建立家庭d",
