  {
   "title": "Global Coffee Chat: Power in Mission",
   "url": "https://wycliffe.net/2026/09/29/global-coffee-chat-power-in-mission/",
   "category": "missionary",
   "source": "Wycliffe",
   "source_url": "https://www.wycliffe.net/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Resources from the Alliance's global conversation about Power in Mission, including a Toolbox your organisation can use.",
   "summary_zh": "来自联盟关于任务中力量的全球对话的资源，包括您的组织可以使用的工具箱。",
   "title_zh": "全球咖啡聊天：使命中的力量",
   "content": "Similar Posts - In Presbyterian seminaries and among a Deaf translation team, a course ignites a shared passion - Training and resources for oral Bible translators are multiplying quickly. In this series of stories and a podcast, we take a closer look. - A beloved Indonesian pastor dies shortly after dedicating Kalumpang Bible; and 1 is dead after YWAM Benin team accident. - Across the Americas and beyond, mesa gatherings are breaking barriers and energising Bible translation movements - As translation projects multiply in Nigeria, so do tech-related challenges - AI is accelerating Bible translation by eliminating ‘drudgery’ and empowering local teams",
   "content_zh": "类似的职位——在长老会神学院和一个聋人翻译小组中,课程点燃了共同的热情——口头翻译圣经的培训和资源迅速增加。 在这一系列的故事和播客中,我们仔细看看。 - 一名敬爱的印度尼西亚牧师在献上《卡朗邦圣经》后不久死亡;一名牧师在YWAM贝宁队事故后死亡。\n\n- 在整个美洲及以外,Mesa集会正在打破障碍,激发圣经翻译运动。 随着尼日利亚翻译项目的增多,与技术有关的挑战也随之增加。",
   "image": "https://wycliffe.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/cropped-logo.png",
   "author": "Jim Killam",
   "tags": [
