  {
   "title": "Wycliffe Global Alliance Communications Workshop – Africa Area",
   "url": "https://wycliffe.net/2026/09/04/africa-area-communications-workshop/",
   "category": "missionary",
   "source": "Wycliffe",
   "source_url": "https://www.wycliffe.net/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "This project seeks to equip trainers who can contextualise and deliver OBT training within Latin America",
   "summary_zh": "该项目旨在为培训师提供能够在拉丁美洲范围内提供OBT培训的背景知识",
   "title_zh": "威克里夫全球联盟传播研讨会–非洲地区",
   "content": "Communication staff at 18 Bible translation organizations across Africa need professional training to tell God’s stories well. In November 2026, a one-week workshop in Ruiru, Kenya will teach practical skills like writing, photography, design and video. Then, six months of follow-up support will continue to strengthen networks and create a collaborative culture of sharing God’s stories widely and effectively. Project Name: Africa Area Communication Capacity Building Workshop Implementing Organization: Wycliffe Global Alliance – Africa Area Contact: Phil Prior Director for Communication Wycliffe Global Alliance phil_prior@wycliffe.net Matthew Bore Project Funding Manager Wycliffe Global Alliance matthew_bore@wycliffe.net Start date: September 2026 End date: March 2027 Summary Across Africa, God is moving. Communities are receiving the Bible in their own language for the first time. Lives are being transformed. But too often, these stories never become known beyond the place where they happen. Why? Because not enough people are trained to recognise and report these stories to a wider audience. Among 18 Bible translation organisations across Africa, communication staff are doing their best—but without formal training in news writing, interviewing, photography, video and social media. Many also work in relative isolation without the chance to exchange ideas and collaborate on stories. The result: Amazing stories remain untold, and the people who could be praying, giving or getting involved never learn about the opportunities. This project changes that. For one week (2-6 November 2026) in Ruiru, Kenya, communication staff from those 18 Wycliffe Global Alliance organisations will come together — not just to sit in a classroom, but to actually create. Using smartphones and free tools, they will learn to capture the moments that matter: local communities and churches collaborating; a translation team’s challenges and creative solutions, groups engaging with Scripture, lives being transformed. Attendees also will build plans for how their organisations will keep telling these types of stories long after the workshop ends. Then, over the ensuing six months, this same group will keep coaching, encouraging, and learning from each other — turning 18 separate voices into one strong, unified story of what God is doing across Africa. Give to this Project Click Give Now to go to our secure giving portal. As you complete the form, you will be asked to ‘Choose a project’. Select Africa Area Communications Workshop . Give Now Budget Total need (in USD): $37,835 Contributions received / pledged: $34,500 Balance needed: $3,335 To learn more about this funding opportunity, email Matthew Bore matthew_bore@wycliffe.net",
   "content_zh": "非洲18个圣经翻译组织的传播人员需要专业培训,才能很好地讲述上帝的故事。 2026年11月,将在肯尼亚鲁伊鲁举办为期一周的讲习班,教授写作,摄影,设计和录像等实用技能. 然后,六个月的后续支持将继续加强网络,并创造一种广泛而有效地分享上帝故事的合作文化。 项目名称: 非洲区域通信能力建设讲习班 执行组织: Wycliffe 全球联盟 – 非洲地区联系人: Phil 通讯前主任 Wycliffe 全球联盟 phil prior@wycliffe.net 马修·伯尔项目资金经理 Wycliffe 全球联盟 matthew bore@wycliffe.net 开始日期:2026年9月 结束日期:2027年3月 总结跨非洲,上帝在移动. 社区首次以自己的语言接受圣经。 众生被化. 但是,这些故事往往从未被人们知道,超越发生它们的地方。 为什么? 因为没有足够的人受过训练 来认识这些故事 并向更广泛的受众报告。 在全非洲的18个圣经翻译组织中,通讯工作人员正在尽了最大的努力,但没有接受新闻写作、采访、摄影、录像和社交媒体方面的正式培训。 许多人还相对孤立地工作,没有机会就故事交流和协作。 结果:令人惊奇的故事仍然无穷无尽,那些可以祈祷、给予或参与的人永远不知道机会。 这个项目改变了这一点。 有一个星期(2026年11月2日至6日),来自Wycliffe全球联盟18个组织的通讯工作人员将聚集一堂, 使用智能手机和免费工具,他们会学会抓住重要的时刻:当地社区和教会合作;翻译团队的挑战和创造性解决方案;参与圣经的团体;生活正在被改变。 学员们还将制定计划,说明他们的组织如何在讲习班结束后很久继续讲述这类故事。 然后,在接下来的六个月里,这个团体将继续相互指导、鼓励和学习——把18个独立的声音变成一个强大、统一的故事,讲述上帝在非洲各地正在做什么。 给这个工程 点击 现在给到我们的安全赠送门户。 填表时,您将被要求选择一个项目。 选定非洲区域通信讲习班。 为了了解这个资助机会,",
   "image": "https://wycliffe.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/cropped-logo.png",
   "author": "Otabil Arthur Otabil Arthur",
   "tags": [
    "PROJECTS"
   ],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
   "flags": [],
