  {
   "title": "Prayer Wall Guidelines",
   "url": "https://wycliffe.net/2026/07/29/prayer-wall-guidelines/",
   "category": "missionary",
   "source": "Wycliffe",
   "source_url": "https://www.wycliffe.net/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Questions or comments? Contact us at: Prayer@wycliffe.net",
   "summary_zh": "有问题或意见？联系我们： Prayer@wycliffe.net",
   "title_zh": "祈祷墙指南",
   "content": "No login is necessary Please use one of the site languages: English, French, Indonesian, Chinese, Portuguese or Spanish Your item will not appear immediately on the wall. Alliance staff must approve it first. Make sure that you have permission to publish your prayer item . Each item will be available online for anyone to view and will be emailed to subscribers. We do not take responsibility for checking content for security risks. You should have direct permission of any named individual for whom you are asking prayer. If you are naming a language group, please ensure there is no security risk in publishing the name of the language group openly on the internet and in association with a Christian organisation. There is a 280-character limit for each item. At this time you cannot add photos or other attachments to your prayer requests. Make your prayers clear and simple; not everyone reading them will understand technical translation terms or acronyms Unless you indicate otherwise, all prayer items will stay on the wall for a maximum of 90 days When you submit your prayer item please include your name and email address in the name section of the form. We will not publish them but it will help us to be able to iron out any issues we encounter and publish the prayer item. Questions or comments? Contact us at: Prayer@wycliffe.net",
   "content_zh": "不需要登录 请使用网站语言之一:英语、法语、印度尼西亚语、中文、葡萄牙语或西班牙语 你的东西不会立刻出现在墙上 联盟工作人员必须首先批准。 确保您拥有发布您的祷告内容的许可 。 每个项目都将在网上供任何人浏览,并将通过电子邮件发送给订阅者。 我们不负责检查安全风险的内容。 任何你要求祷告的人,你都应该直接得到允许。 如果您在命名一个语言团体, 请确保不会在互联网上公开发布该语言团体的名称, 每个项目都有280个特性限制。 您目前无法在祈祷请求中添加相片或其他附件 。 让你的祷告简单明了,不是每个人都会理解技术翻译术语或缩略语,除非你另有说明,所有祷告内容都将在墙上停留最多90天. 提交祷告项目时,请在表格中的名称栏目中填写您的姓名和电子邮件地址。 我们不会出版它们,但它将有助于我们解决我们遇到的任何问题并出版祈祷品。 问题或评论? 联系我们: prayer@wycliffe.net",
   "image": "https://wycliffe.net/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/cropped-logo.png",
   "author": "Otabil Arthur Otabil Arthur",
