   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "Beautiful objects and people convey the transcendent to us, but are not the transcendent, bigger ‘thing’ that we are reaching out for. The hunger for the beautiful is really a desire for what beauty points us to: the wholeness, harmony, and glory that can only be found in God. And here’s what I think I...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "美丽的物品和人民向我们传达超凡的事物, 对美人的饥渴,其实是对美人告诉我们的欲望:只有上帝才能找到的完整,和谐,荣耀. 我认为,",
   "title_zh": "需要引起注意的美貌需求",
   "content": "Beautiful objects and people convey the transcendent to us, but are not the transcendent, bigger ‘thing’ that we are reaching out for. The hunger for the beautiful is really a desire for what beauty points us to: the wholeness, harmony, and glory that can only be found in God. And here’s what I think I... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "美丽的物品和人民向我们传达超凡的事物, 对美人的饥渴,其实是对美人告诉我们的欲望:只有上帝才能找到的完整,和谐,荣耀. 我认为,",
