   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "Perhaps we should wait until the full movie is released to draw our conclusions, But, thus far, it seems that Greta is rejecting the significance of Aslan in the same way that she rejects the significance of Jesus. In fact, in an interview with Crash magazine she stated, “I get uncomfortable around ‘Jesus Christ is...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "也许我们应该等到电影全文上映后再得出结论,但到目前为止,看来格蕾塔正以她拒绝耶稣意义的方式拒绝阿斯兰的意义. 事实上,她在接受Crash杂志采访时指出,“我感到不舒服, 继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "Aslan Sane ：纳尼亚的Bowiefication",
   "content": "Perhaps we should wait until the full movie is released to draw our conclusions, But, thus far, it seems that Greta is rejecting the significance of Aslan in the same way that she rejects the significance of Jesus. In fact, in an interview with Crash magazine she stated, “I get uncomfortable around ‘Jesus Christ is... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "也许我们应该等到电影全文上映后再得出结论,但到目前为止,看来格蕾塔正以她拒绝耶稣意义的方式拒绝阿斯兰的意义. 事实上,她在接受Crash杂志采访时指出,“我感到不舒服, 继续阅读",
   "image": "",
   "author": "Stephen McAlpine",
