   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-04",
   "summary": "Accountability is accepting the consequences of one’s own choices, even if those consequences are painful. It is being willing to submit to external review, being open and honest with those who have been placed in that role to examine you. Accountability is having explicit standards for behavior and an actual, substantive process and penalties for...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "问责制正在接受自己选择的后果,即使这些后果是痛苦的。 它愿意接受外部审查,对担任这一职务的人公开和诚实地审查你。 问责制对行为有明确的标准,对.有实际、实质性的程序和惩罚。 继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "问责制和个人责任",
   "content": "Accountability is accepting the consequences of one’s own choices, even if those consequences are painful. It is being willing to submit to external review, being open and honest with those who have been placed in that role to examine you. Accountability is having explicit standards for behavior and an actual, substantive process and penalties for... Continue Reading",
