   "title": "Some Language Changes Come from Sin. Others Are Natural.",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/kjv-bible-language-changes-come-from-sin-others-are-natural/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-08",
   "summary": "Language change gets our attention mainly, I think, when it is controversial. Even openly non-Christian and self-confessedly liberal journalist Nicholas Kristof of The New York Times has expressed alarm at the ideological attempts at language change that have been so divisive in recent years, writing, Latino to Latinx. Women to people with uteruses. Homeless to  Read more...   The post  Some Language Changes Come from Sin. Others Are Natural.  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "我认为,语言变化主要是在引起争议时引起我们的注意。 即使是公开的非基督教和自以为是的自由派记者\"纽约时报\"的尼古拉斯·克里斯托夫(Nicholas Kristof)也曾对近年来语言变迁的意识形态尝试表示震惊,这种变迁在写作,拉丁语和拉丁语之间一直存在分歧. 女人对有子宫的人。 无家可归去读更多...\n\n在今日基督教上,",
   "title_zh": "有些语言变化来自罪恶。有些是天然的。",
   "content": "Language change gets our attention mainly, I think, when it is controversial. Even openly non-Christian and self-confessedly liberal journalist Nicholas Kristof of The New York Times has expressed alarm at the ideological attempts at language change that have been so divisive in recent years, writing, Latino to Latinx. Women to people with uteruses. Homeless to Read more... The post Some Language Changes Come from Sin. Others Are Natural. appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "我认为,语言变化主要是在引起争议时引起我们的注意。 即使是公开的非基督教和自以为是的自由派记者\"纽约时报\"的尼古拉斯·克里斯托夫(Nicholas Kristof)也曾对近年来语言变迁的意识形态尝试表示震惊,这种变迁在写作,拉丁语和拉丁语之间一直存在分歧. 女人对有子宫的人。 无家可归去读更多...\n\n在今日基督教上,",
