  {
   "title": "After the Midterms",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/after-the-midterms/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "The election is over, and the results are clear. Exactly two years ago, a certain wave crashed, and the future seemed inevitable. This morning, the tide turned, and our political life once again feels unstable, dramatic, dynamic, contentious. Jesus regularly stepped into the political and religious controversies of his day, always bringing peace that couldn’t  Read more...   The post  After the Midterms  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "选举结束了，结果很清楚。整整两年前，某个浪潮崩溃了，未来似乎是不可避免的。今天早上，潮流转向，我们的政治生活再次感到不稳定、戏剧化、充满活力、充满争议。耶稣经常介入他那个时代的政治和宗教争议，总是带来无法阅读更多内容的和平……期中考试后的帖子首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "期中考试结束后",
   "content": "The election is over, and the results are clear. Exactly two years ago, a certain wave crashed, and the future seemed inevitable. This morning, the tide turned, and our political life once again feels unstable, dramatic, dynamic, contentious. Jesus regularly stepped into the political and religious controversies of his day, always bringing peace that couldn’t Read more... The post After the Midterms appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "选举结束了，结果很清楚。整整两年前，某个浪潮崩溃了，未来似乎是不可避免的。今天早上，潮流转向，我们的政治生活再次感到不稳定、戏剧化、充满活力、充满争议。耶稣经常介入他那个时代的政治和宗教争议，总是带来无法阅读更多内容的和平……期中考试后的帖子首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/behind-the-story-cream-169.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Erik Petrik",
   "tags": [
    "Uncategorized",
    "Christianity Today"
   ],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
