  {
   "title": "Why I Am Still a Christian",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/why-i-am-still-a-christian/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "This piece was adapted from Russell Moore’s newsletter. Subscribe here. One October night back in the 1980s, an adolescent boy walked down the road outside his home in the Woolmarket community of Biloxi, Mississippi, in anguish. He was facing all the questions anybody his age faces—What am I going to do with my life? What really matters?—but  Read more...   The post  Why I Am Still a Christian  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "这篇文章改编自Russell Moore的时事通讯。点击此处订阅。20世纪80年代的一个10月夜晚，一名青少年男孩痛苦地走在他位于密西西比州比洛克西市Woolmarket社区的家外面的道路上。他面临着他这个年纪的人所面临的所有问题--我该如何度过我的人生？真正重要的是什么？ -但阅读更多……《为什么我仍然是基督徒》一文首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "为什么我还是基督徒",
   "content": "This piece was adapted from Russell Moore’s newsletter. Subscribe here. One October night back in the 1980s, an adolescent boy walked down the road outside his home in the Woolmarket community of Biloxi, Mississippi, in anguish. He was facing all the questions anybody his age faces—What am I going to do with my life? What really matters?—but Read more... The post Why I Am Still a Christian appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "这篇文章改编自Russell Moore的时事通讯。点击此处订阅。20世纪80年代的一个10月夜晚，一名青少年男孩痛苦地走在他位于密西西比州比洛克西市Woolmarket社区的家外面的道路上。他面临着他这个年纪的人所面临的所有问题--我该如何度过我的人生？真正重要的是什么？ -但阅读更多……《为什么我仍然是基督徒》一文首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/why-i-am-still-christian.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Russell Moore",
   "tags": [
