   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-08",
   "summary": "Tears welled up in Sunitha Rani’s eyes and her voice softened as she recounted the agonizing wait her family had to endure to secure a grave plot for her husband, who died at age 66 last year. Rani and her children wanted to bury John Sukumar in the southern Indian city of Hyderabad, where he  Read more...   The post  As Christianity Grows in India, Burial Space Shrinks  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "Sunitha Rani的眼中涌出泪水，她的声音变得柔和，因为她讲述了她的家人不得不忍受的痛苦等待，以确保她的丈夫的坟墓情节，她的丈夫去年去世，享年66岁。Rani和她的孩子们想将John Sukumar埋葬在印度南部城市海得拉巴，在那里他阅读更多...随着基督教在印度的发展， Burial Space Shrinks首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "随着基督教在印度的发展，埋葬空间缩小",
   "content": "Tears welled up in Sunitha Rani’s eyes and her voice softened as she recounted the agonizing wait her family had to endure to secure a grave plot for her husband, who died at age 66 last year. Rani and her children wanted to bury John Sukumar in the southern Indian city of Hyderabad, where he Read more... The post As Christianity Grows in India, Burial Space Shrinks appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "Sunitha Rani的眼中涌出泪水，她的声音变得柔和，因为她讲述了她的家人不得不忍受的痛苦等待，以确保她的丈夫的坟墓情节，她的丈夫去年去世，享年66岁。Rani和她的孩子们想将John Sukumar埋葬在印度南部城市海得拉巴，在那里他阅读更多...随着基督教在印度的发展， Burial Space Shrinks首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
