  {
   "title": "Give While We Live",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/11/05/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "With his team winning comfortably, Philadelphia Eagles’ superstar football player Saquon Barkley rested on the bench. There was no need for him to continue playing. Then his coach approached and told him he was close to breaking a record.",
   "summary_zh": "在他的球队轻松获胜的情况下，费城老鹰队的超级明星足球运动员萨昆·巴克利（ Saquon Barkley ）坐在板凳上。他没有必要继续玩下去。然后他的教练走近他，告诉他他即将打破纪录。",
   "title_zh": "在我们活着的时候付出",
   "content": "Our Daily Bread Devotionals",
   "content_zh": "我们的每日面包祈祷会",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
   "author": "Tim Gustafson",
   "tags": [],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
   "flags": [],
   "priority": 2,
   "fetched_at": "2026-11-11T00:25:57.098673",
   "extra": {
    "feed_type": "rss20"
   },
   "id": "e7641d223af0f513"
  },
  {
   "title": "Our Advocate, Jesus Christ",
   "url": "https://reformation21.org/our-advocate-jesus-christ/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "Reformation21",
   "source_url": "https://reformation21.org/feed",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Some nights, our conscience needs no help assembling its case. Words we cannot take back, sins we thought were buried, and promises to change that we have broken return with unwelcome clarity. We lie awake rehearsing explanations that sound less convincing each time, until we scarcely know whether we are defending ourselves or adding to […]",
   "summary_zh": "有些夜晚，我们的良心不需要帮助组装箱子。我们无法收回的话语，我们认为被埋葬的罪孽，以及承诺改变我们已经以不受欢迎的清晰度打破了回报。我们清醒地排练每次听起来不那么令人信服的解释，直到我们几乎不知道我们是在为自己辩护还是在增加[…]",
   "title_zh": "我们的倡导者，耶稣基督",
   "content": "Some nights, our conscience needs no help assembling its case. Words we cannot take back, sins we thought were buried, and promises to change that we have broken return with unwelcome clarity. We lie awake rehearsing explanations that sound less convincing each time, until we scarcely know whether we are defending ourselves or adding to […]",
   "content_zh": "有些夜晚，我们的良心不需要帮助组装箱子。我们无法收回的话语，我们认为被埋葬的罪孽，以及承诺改变我们已经以不受欢迎的清晰度打破了回报。我们清醒地排练每次听起来不那么令人信服的解释，直到我们几乎不知道我们是在为自己辩护还是在增加[…]",
   "image": "https://reformation21.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/readingitrightly-1024x449.jpg",
   "author": "Gideon Rossouw",
   "tags": [
    "Reformation21",
    "Christian Living",
