   "source_url": "https://www.desiringgod.org/blog.rss",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Why is wisdom more satisfying than wealth? John Piper opens Proverbs 24:13 to show how wisdom leads to everlasting happiness that riches cannot buy. Watch Now",
   "summary_zh": "为什么智慧比财富更令人满意？约翰·派博（ John Piper ）打开箴言24:13 ，展示智慧如何带来财富买不到的永恒幸福。立即观看",
   "title_zh": "优于黄金",
   "content": "Wisdom That Leads to Life Part 2 Episode 930 Better Than Gold Why is wisdom more satisfying than wealth? John Piper opens Proverbs 24:13 to show how wisdom leads to everlasting happiness that riches cannot buy.",
   "content_zh": "通往生命的智慧第2部第930集胜过黄金为什么智慧比财富更令人满足？约翰·派博打开《箴言》24:13，展示智慧如何带来财富买不到的永恒幸福。",
   "image": "https://dg.imgix.net/resources/17927/media/abcee8a2-7015-451a-97c7-e6feabb987b5/landscape/better-than-gold-en.jpg?ts=1791402029&auto=format%2Ccompress&fit=min&w=1600&h=900&dpr=2&ch=Width%2CDPR",
