   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "It’s through each other that we can be reminded of the truth of who God is and what He’s done for us in Christ. We find strength for our faith. And it’s through each other that we find the courage and fortitude to get up and keep going. The Thessalonians, like other early churches,...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "通过彼此，我们可以被提醒神是谁的真理，以及他在基督里为我们做了什么。我们为自己的信念找到力量。正是通过彼此，我们才有勇气和毅力站起来继续前进。帖撒罗尼迦人，像其他早期教会一样， ……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "我们在试用期间互相赠送的2份礼物",
   "content": "It’s through each other that we can be reminded of the truth of who God is and what He’s done for us in Christ. We find strength for our faith. And it’s through each other that we find the courage and fortitude to get up and keep going.   The Thessalonians, like other early churches,... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "通过彼此，我们可以想起上帝是谁以及他在基督里为我们所做的事情的真相。我们为我们的信仰找到力量。正是通过彼此，我们找到了站起来并继续前进的勇气和毅力。   帖撒罗尼迦教会，像其他早期教会一样，... 继续阅读",
