   "title": "Wrestling with God",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/wrestling-with-god/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "Why should endless trouble call for songs of loudest praise? Because through the night we may grieve and mourn the unrealized ‘perfect life’ of our dreams and struggle against trials and God’s rule, but in the light of day, we see clearly how His grace and mercy have preserved our lives and left us changed...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "为什么无休止的麻烦需要大声赞美的歌曲？因为在整个夜晚，我们可能会悲伤和哀悼我们梦想中未实现的“完美生活” ，与考验和上帝的统治作斗争，但在白天，我们清楚地看到他的恩典和怜悯如何保护我们的生命，让我们改变……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "与神摔跤",
   "content": "Why should endless trouble call for songs of loudest praise? Because through the night we may grieve and mourn the unrealized ‘perfect life’ of our dreams and struggle against trials and God’s rule, but in the light of day, we see clearly how His grace and mercy have preserved our lives and left us changed... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "为什么无尽的烦恼需要最响亮的赞美之歌？因为整夜我们可能会为我们梦想中未实现的“完美生活”而悲伤和哀悼，并与试炼和上帝的统治作斗争，但在白天，我们清楚地看到他的恩典和怜悯如何保存了我们的生命并让我们改变了……继续阅读",
