   "summary_zh": "不要害怕圣经与你的生活背道而驰。相反，祈求神的恩典使你接受祂的话语，并寻找你内心的每一个角落，使你顺服祂的旨意。当您去教堂时，您希望得到什么...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "Going Against the Grain",
   "content": "Don’t fear having the Scriptures go against the grain of your life. Rather, pray that by God’s grace He would make you receptive to His word and seek out the every corner of your heart to bring you in conformity to His will.   When you go to church what do you hope to get... Continue Reading",
