   "title": "A Mixed Multitude",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/a-mixed-multitude/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "We should be concerned by Christians who dabble in witchcraft, or use Tarot cards, or attend seances. We should be concerned by Christians who flirt with false religions. We should be just as concerned by the much more insidious religion of materialism and by an approach to life that thinks Christianity is for Sunday mornings....  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "我们应该关注那些涉足巫术、使用塔罗牌或参加降神仪式的基督徒。我们应该关注那些与虚假宗教调情的基督徒。我们应该同样关注更阴险的唯物主义宗教，以及认为基督教是星期天早晨的生活方式。继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "混合人群",
   "content": "We should be concerned by Christians who dabble in witchcraft, or use Tarot cards, or attend seances. We should be concerned by Christians who flirt with false religions. We should be just as concerned by the much more insidious religion of materialism and by an approach to life that thinks Christianity is for Sunday mornings.... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "我们应该关注那些涉足巫术、使用塔罗牌或参加降神会的基督徒。我们应该关注那些与错误宗教调情的基督徒。我们应该同样关注更为阴险的唯物主义宗教，以及认为基督教只适合周日早晨的生活方式……继续阅读",
