   "title": "Preaching in Paragraphs",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/preaching-in-paragraphs/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "Thinking of a sermon in terms of its paragraphs will help the preacher be more deliberate about how he constructs his sermon. As paragraph follows paragraph, he’ll be able to track the development of his sermon’s main idea, be alert to possible imbalances and unhelpful diversions, and stay sensitive to the need for varying his...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "从段落的角度思考讲道，将有助于传道者更仔细地思考他如何构建讲道。正如段落后面的段落，他将能够跟踪他讲道的主要思想的发展，警惕可能的不平衡和无益的分心，并对改变他……的需要保持敏感。继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "在段落中讲道",
   "content": "Thinking of a sermon in terms of its paragraphs will help the preacher be more deliberate about how he constructs his sermon. As paragraph follows paragraph, he’ll be able to track the development of his sermon’s main idea, be alert to possible imbalances and unhelpful diversions, and stay sensitive to the need for varying his... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "根据讲道的段落来思考讲道将有助于讲道者更加深思熟虑地构建他的讲道。随着一段接着一段，他将能够跟踪讲道主要思想的发展，警惕可能的不平衡和无益的转移，并对改变他的...继续阅读",
   "image": "https://1ar.s3.amazonaws.com/2022/07/mountains_landscape_nature_mountain_lake_forest_1200.jpg",
   "author": "Reuben Bredenhof",
