  {
   "title": "Safely Bound in Jesus",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/safely-bound-in-jesus/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-05",
   "summary": "The safety and security we receive in being bound in Jesus is not because we’re just so good at being Christians. No; being safe and securely bound in Jesus is because of Jesus. Does your walk with Jesus fluctuate? I think it does for everyone. We have good and bad days; we have triumphant...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "我们在耶稣里被捆绑所获得的安全和保障，并不是因为我们非常擅长成为基督徒。不；在耶稣里安全可靠地被捆绑是因为耶稣。你与耶稣同行是否波动？我认为这对每个人都有好处。我们有好日子和坏日子；我们有胜利...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "安全地捆绑在耶稣里",
   "content": "The safety and security we receive in being bound in Jesus is not because we’re just so good at being Christians. No; being safe and securely bound in Jesus is because of Jesus.   Does your walk with Jesus fluctuate? I think it does for everyone. We have good and bad days; we have triumphant... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "我们在耶稣的捆绑中所获得的安全和保障并不是因为我们很擅长成为基督徒。不;因耶稣而安全可靠地被耶稣所束缚。   你与耶稣同行的道路有波动吗？我认为这对每个人都适用。我们有好日子，也有坏日子；我们胜利了...继续阅读",
   "image": "https://1ar.s3.amazonaws.com/2022/07/mountains_landscape_nature_mountain_lake_forest_1200.jpg",
   "author": "Blake Long",
   "tags": [
    "Biblical and Theological",
