  {
   "title": "The State of the Pro-Life Movement After the Midterms",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/midterms-abortion-prolife-trump-missouri-nevada-virginia-idaho/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Amid a national blue wave on election night, US voters considered a series of ballot measures over abortion, with the pro-choice cause largely winning the night. Measures adding constitutional rights for abortion passed in Virginia and Nevada, and Missouri voters rejected a ballot measure restricting abortion. The lone victory for the pro-life movement was in  Read more...   The post  The State of the Pro-Life Movement After the Midterms  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "在选举之夜的一场全国蓝色浪潮中,美国选民考虑了一系列针对堕胎的投票措施,支持选择的事业基本上赢得了当晚的胜利. 弗吉尼亚州和内华达州通过了增加堕胎宪法权利的措施,密苏里州选民否决了限制堕胎的投票措施. 支持生命运动的孤独胜利在读更多...\n\n中后期之后的亲生运动国家,",
   "title_zh": "中期选举后反堕胎运动的现状",
   "content": "Amid a national blue wave on election night, US voters considered a series of ballot measures over abortion, with the pro-choice cause largely winning the night. Measures adding constitutional rights for abortion passed in Virginia and Nevada, and Missouri voters rejected a ballot measure restricting abortion. The lone victory for the pro-life movement was in Read more... The post The State of the Pro-Life Movement After the Midterms appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "在选举之夜的一场全国蓝色浪潮中,美国选民考虑了一系列针对堕胎的投票措施,支持选择的事业基本上赢得了当晚的胜利. 弗吉尼亚州和内华达州通过了增加堕胎宪法权利的措施,密苏里州选民否决了限制堕胎的投票措施. 支持生命运动的孤独胜利在读更多...\n\n中后期之后的亲生运动国家,",
