   "title": "Tanzania Pressures Churches to Promote Tax Policies",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/tanzania-pressures-churches-to-promote-tax-policies/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "Around 5 p.m. on October 29, 2025, Simon Patilo heard gunshots break out across his street in Dodoma, the capital of Tanzania. Earlier in the day, protesters descended on the streets of Dar es Salaam, about 280 miles east of Dodoma, demanding electoral reforms in the largest protest since the country gained independence from Britain  Read more...   The post  Tanzania Pressures Churches to Promote Tax Policies  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "2025年10月29日下午5时左右,西蒙·帕蒂洛(英语:Simon Patilo)在坦桑尼亚首都多多马的街道上听到枪声爆发. 当天早些时候,抗议者在多多马以东约280英里的达累斯萨拉姆街头倒下,要求进行选举改革,这是该国从英国独立以来最大的抗议活动. Read more.\n\n坦桑尼亚教会推动税收政策,",
   "title_zh": "坦桑尼亚迫使教会推动税收政策",
   "content": "Around 5 p.m. on October 29, 2025, Simon Patilo heard gunshots break out across his street in Dodoma, the capital of Tanzania. Earlier in the day, protesters descended on the streets of Dar es Salaam, about 280 miles east of Dodoma, demanding electoral reforms in the largest protest since the country gained independence from Britain Read more... The post Tanzania Pressures Churches to Promote Tax Policies appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "2025年10月29日下午5点左右，西蒙·帕蒂洛（ Simon Patilo ）在坦桑尼亚首都多多马（ Dodoma ）的街道上听到枪声。当天早些时候，抗议者走上多多马以东约280英里的达累斯萨拉姆街头，要求进行选举改革，这是该国脱离英国独立以来最大规模的抗议活动。阅读更多...坦桑尼亚施压教会推动税收政策后，首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tanzania-pressures-churches-tax-policies.jpg?resize=1200,628",
