   "title": "Presbyterian Church in America Receives Proposal To Condemn IVF Destruction Of Embryos",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/presbyterian-church-in-america-receives-proposal-to-condemn-ivf-destruction-of-embryos/",
   "category": "giant",
