   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "The Presbyterian Church in America’s official media arm last week said the denomination would consider a proposal to officially condemn in vitro fertilization procedures that destroy embryos. The denomination’s Southeast Alabama Presbytery submitted the proposal to be voted upon at the PCA’s next general assembly, scheduled for June 2027. Read More",
   "summary_zh": "上周，美国官方媒体部门的长老会表示，该教派将考虑正式谴责破坏胚胎的体外受精程序的提案。该教派的阿拉巴马州东南部长老会提交了该提案，供定于2027年6月举行的PCA下一次大会表决。阅读更多",
   "title_zh": "美国长老会收到谴责体外受精破坏胚胎的提案",
   "content": "The Presbyterian Church in America’s official media arm last week said the denomination would consider a proposal to officially condemn in vitro fertilization procedures that destroy embryos. The denomination’s Southeast Alabama Presbytery submitted the proposal to be voted upon at the PCA’s next general assembly, scheduled for June 2027. Read More",
   "content_zh": "上周，美国官方媒体部门的长老会表示，该教派将考虑正式谴责破坏胚胎的体外受精程序的提案。该教派的阿拉巴马州东南部长老会提交了该提案，供定于2027年6月举行的PCA下一次大会表决。阅读更多",
