   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Christians are not to develop a phobia of the world or of unbelievers. Why? Because the outcome of the battle has already been decided. This does not mean retreating into a Christian enclave. It means faithfully engaging the world God has placed around us. Only let your conduct be worthy of the gospel of...  Continue Reading",
