   "summary": "When everything that we thought was stable collapses, we can reassure ourselves that God remains stable and available to us as a refuge. We have a confident hope. Therefore, we do not have to be afraid. I read quite a few predictions of doom over the weekend, including some from self-professed tech optimists. Supposedly,...  Continue Reading",
