   "title": "The Blessed Life",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/the-blessed-life/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "The gospel reminds us that we are sinners in desperate need of grace. But it also gloriously reveals that there is a Savior who has walked in God’s ways on our behalf so that we can be blessed. In Christ believers have an inheritance that far surpasses anything this world has to offer. What...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "福音提醒我们，我们是迫切需要恩典的罪人。但它也荣耀地显示，有一位救主代表我们行在神的道路上，使我们蒙受祝福。在基督里，信徒拥有的遗产远远超过这个世界所能提供的任何东西。内容...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "幸福的生活",
   "content": "The gospel reminds us that we are sinners in desperate need of grace. But it also gloriously reveals that there is a Savior who has walked in God’s ways on our behalf so that we can be blessed. In Christ believers have an inheritance that far surpasses anything this world has to offer.   What... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "福音提醒我们，我们是迫切需要恩典的罪人。但它也荣耀地显示，有一位救主代表我们行在神的道路上，使我们蒙受祝福。在基督里，信徒拥有的遗产远远超过这个世界所能提供的任何东西。内容...继续阅读",
