   "title": "Amid Mixed Pew Findings, Youngest Adults Outpace Parents’ Generation in Worship Attendance",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/amid-mixed-pew-findings-youngest-adults-outpace-parents-generation-in-worship-attendance/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "Pew’s report says it’s too soon to tell whether the findings about young people’s religious life are a blip or the start of a larger trend, noting scholars study religious change over decades. (RNS)—Amid anecdotal claims of a Gen Z religious revival, religion data analysts have been working over the last year to determine...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "皮尤的报告指出，现在判断关于年轻人宗教生活的调查结果是昙花一现还是一个更大趋势的开始还为时过早，并指出学者们研究了几十年来的宗教变化。（ RNS ） -在Z世代宗教复兴的轶事声称中，宗教数据分析师在过去一年中一直在努力确定...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "在混合的皮尤调查结果中，最年轻的成年人在礼拜出席率方面超过了父母一代",
   "content": "Pew’s report says it’s too soon to tell whether the findings about young people’s religious life are a blip or the start of a larger trend, noting scholars study religious change over decades.    (RNS)—Amid anecdotal claims of a Gen Z religious revival, religion data analysts have been working over the last year to determine... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "皮尤的报告指出，现在判断关于年轻人宗教生活的调查结果是昙花一现还是一个更大趋势的开始还为时过早，并指出学者们研究了几十年来的宗教变化。（ RNS ） -在Z世代宗教复兴的轶事声称中，宗教数据分析师在过去一年中一直在努力确定...继续阅读",
   "image": "https://1ar.s3.amazonaws.com/2022/07/mountains_landscape_nature_mountain_lake_forest_1200.jpg",
   "author": "Kathryn Post",
   "tags": [
    "Featured",
    "Opinion"
   ],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
