   "title": "Who Is the God of the Bible?",
   "url": "https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/podcasts/tgc-podcast/who-god-bible/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "The Gospel Coalition",
   "source_url": "https://www.thegospelcoalition.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Contemplating God’s names provides a deeper understanding of his being and attributes and a firmer foundation for our faith and hope.",
   "summary_zh": "沉思神的名字可以更深入地了解祂的存在和属性，并为我们的信心和希望奠定更坚实的基础。",
   "title_zh": "谁是圣经中的神？",
   "content": "According to the Belgic Confession , God reveals himself to us in two “books”: the book of nature (God’s world) and the book of Scripture (God’s written Word). The primary way God reveals himself in the book of Scripture is by proclaiming his name. In this first of two paired lectures from TGC25, Scott Swain considers several of the names whereby God reveals himself in the Bible. Contemplating God’s names provides a deeper understanding of his being and attributes and a firmer foundation for our faith and hope. It also helps us better appreciate the ways God reveals himself to us in Jesus Christ. In This Episode 00:08 – The importance of knowing God 03:09 – Divine names in Scripture 07:47 – Defining true religion via names 10:33 – Lessons from Numbers 23 16:05 – The power of divine negation 33:32 – God revealed through analogy 40:46 – Attributes of the transcendent God 48:29 – Jesus Christ as supreme revelation SIGN UP for one of our newsletters to stay informed about TGC’s latest resources. Help The Gospel Coalition renew and unify the contemporary church in the ancient gospel: Give today . Don’t miss an episode of The Gospel Coalition Podcast : Apple Podcasts Spotify YouTube",
   "content_zh": "根据贝尔吉克的忏悔书,上帝在两个\"书\"中向我们揭示了自己:自然之书(真主的世界)和天经之书(真主所写的文字). 神在\"通典\"中主要揭示自己的方式是宣布自己的名字. 在TGC25的两次对口讲座中,斯科特·斯温(Scott Swain)首先考虑了上帝在\"圣经\"中揭示自己的几个名字.\n\n质疑上帝的名声为人们更深入地了解他的存在和属性,并为我们的信仰和希望打下更坚实的基础。 这也帮助我们更好地理解上帝在耶稣基督中向我们揭示自己的方式.\n\n在这部第00:08集中 — — 了解上帝的重要性 03:09 — — 圣经中的神名 07:47 — — 通过名字定义真正的宗教 10:33 — — 从第23号16:05中吸取的教训 33:32 — 上帝通过类比揭示了神的力量 40:46 — 超凡神的属性 48:29 — — 耶稣基督作为最高启示 SIGN UP,让我们的通讯之一能够了解TGC的最新资源.\n\ns. 帮助福音联盟更新并统一了古代福音中的当代教会:今天赐予. 不要错过福音联盟的一集 Podcast: Apple Podcasts Spotify YouTube",
   "image": "https://media.thegospelcoalition.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/27132952/479.-TGC-Podcast-Thumbnail-with-Logo-16x9-2.png",
   "author": "Scott R. Swain",
   "tags": [
    "Podcast",
    "Bible",
    "Nature of God",
    "Systematic Theology"
   ],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
