  {
   "title": "Three Reasons Billy Graham Captured the World’s Attention",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/three-reasons-billy-graham-captured-worlds-attention/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Recently my wife, Katherine, and I moved into a senior living complex in our hometown of Cary, North Carolina. Soon afterward the building manager, a young man from Ghana named Godfred, knocked on our apartment door. He had seen a stack of books about Billy Graham outside the door and wondered if he could borrow  Read more...   The post  Three Reasons Billy Graham Captured the World’s Attention  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "最近，我和妻子凯瑟琳搬进了我们家乡北卡罗来纳州卡里市的一个养老院。不久之后，大楼经理，一个来自加纳的名叫戈弗雷德的年轻人，敲了我们的公寓门。他在门外看到一堆关于比利·葛培理（ Billy Graham ）的书，想知道他是否可以借阅更多……帖子《比利·葛培理吸引世界注意力的三个原因》（ Three Reasons Billy Graham Captured the World's Attention ）首先出现在《今日基督教",
   "title_zh": "比利·格雷厄姆吸引世界注意力的三个原因",
   "content": "Recently my wife, Katherine, and I moved into a senior living complex in our hometown of Cary, North Carolina. Soon afterward the building manager, a young man from Ghana named Godfred, knocked on our apartment door. He had seen a stack of books about Billy Graham outside the door and wondered if he could borrow Read more... The post Three Reasons Billy Graham Captured the World’s Attention appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "最近，我和妻子凯瑟琳搬进了我们家乡北卡罗来纳州卡里市的一个养老院。不久之后，大楼经理，一个来自加纳的名叫戈弗雷德的年轻人，敲了我们的公寓门。他在门外看到一堆关于比利·葛培理（ Billy Graham ）的书，想知道他是否可以借阅更多……帖子《比利·葛培理吸引世界注意力的三个原因》（ Three Reasons Billy Graham Captured the World's Attention ）首先出现在《今日基督教",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/billy-graham-legacy.jpg?resize=1200,628",
