   "title": "Shock, Anger, Stimulate, Numb",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/tech-formation-social-media-ai-shock-anger-stimulate-numb-faith/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "How can Christians wisely navigate generative artificial intelligence, divisive social media algorithms, and new uses of technology that have (and could have) widespread ramifications? In this video from CT’s Big Tent convening in Oakland, California, Felicia Wu Song and Brian Doak sat down with Haleluya Hadero to discuss the ways technology can form us and  Read more...   The post  Shock, Anger, Stimulate, Numb  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "基督徒如何明智地导航基因人工智能、分裂的社交媒体算法, 在加州奥克兰的CT大帐篷集会的影片中,\n\n之后的震撼,愤怒,刺激,Numb首先出现在了今日基督教上.",
   "title_zh": "电击、愤怒、刺激、麻木",
   "content": "How can Christians wisely navigate generative artificial intelligence, divisive social media algorithms, and new uses of technology that have (and could have) widespread ramifications? In this video from CT’s Big Tent convening in Oakland, California, Felicia Wu Song and Brian Doak sat down with Haleluya Hadero to discuss the ways technology can form us and Read more... The post Shock, Anger, Stimulate, Numb appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "基督徒如何明智地驾驭生成性人工智能、分裂性的社交媒体算法以及具有（并且可能具有）广泛影响的技术的新用途？在CT在加利福尼亚州奥克兰召集的大帐篷中的这段视频中， Felicia Wu Song和Brian Doak与Haleluya Hadero坐下来讨论技术如何形成我们并阅读更多...后震惊，愤怒，刺激，麻木首次出现在今天的基督教上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/big-tent-panel-ai-tech-song-doak.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Haleluya Hadero",
   "tags": [
    "Church Life",
    "CT Originals",
