   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "This piece was adapted from CT’s books newsletter. Subscribe here. Azadeh Moaveni, The East Wing: Power, Intrigue, and the Untold Story of America’s First Ladies (St. Martin’s Press, 2026) Last year, workers tore down the East Wing of the White House so that President Donald Trump could build a new state ballroom, demolishing in the process  Read more...   The post  Hard, Soft, and Spiritual Power  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "这篇文章改编自CT的书籍通讯。在这里订阅。Azadeh Moaveni, The East Wing: Power, Intrigue, and the Untold Story of America's First Ladies (St. Martin's Press, 2026)去年，工人们拆除了白宫东翼，以便唐纳德·特朗普总统可以建造一个新的国家宴会厅，并在此过程中拆除阅读更多...《今日基督教》上首次出现了硬，软和精神力量的帖子。",
   "title_zh": "硬实力、软实力、灵力",
   "content": "This piece was adapted from CT’s books newsletter. Subscribe here. Azadeh Moaveni, The East Wing: Power, Intrigue, and the Untold Story of America’s First Ladies (St. Martin’s Press, 2026) Last year, workers tore down the East Wing of the White House so that President Donald Trump could build a new state ballroom, demolishing in the process Read more... The post Hard, Soft, and Spiritual Power appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "这篇文章改编自CT的书籍通讯。在这里订阅。Azadeh Moaveni, The East Wing: Power, Intrigue, and the Untold Story of America's First Ladies (St. Martin's Press, 2026)去年，工人们拆除了白宫东翼，以便唐纳德·特朗普总统可以建造一个新的国家宴会厅，并在此过程中拆除阅读更多...《今日基督教》上首次出现了硬，软和精神力量的帖子。",
