   "title": "Political Turmoil Needs More Than Political Solutions",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/europe-unrest-moral-spiritual-renewal/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Europe is burning. Not everywhere, and not all at once. But the recurring images of cars aflame, shattered storefronts, angry crowds, and riot police on the streets of Germany, Spain, Italy, and France should concern us. For American Christians, they may warn of a future we are not prepared to face. We have become accustomed  Read more...   The post  Political Turmoil Needs More Than Political Solutions  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "欧洲正在燃烧。不是到处都是，也不是同时到处都是。但是，德国、西班牙、意大利和法国街头反复出现的汽车着火、店面破碎、愤怒的人群和防暴警察的画面应该引起我们的关注。对于美国基督徒来说，他们可能会警告我们不准备面对的未来。我们已经习惯了阅读更多...后政治动荡需要的不仅仅是政治解决方案首先出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "政治动荡需要的不仅仅是政治解决方案",
   "content": "Europe is burning. Not everywhere, and not all at once. But the recurring images of cars aflame, shattered storefronts, angry crowds, and riot police on the streets of Germany, Spain, Italy, and France should concern us. For American Christians, they may warn of a future we are not prepared to face. We have become accustomed Read more... The post Political Turmoil Needs More Than Political Solutions appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "欧洲正在燃烧。不是到处都是，也不是同时到处都是。但是，德国、西班牙、意大利和法国街头反复出现的汽车着火、店面破碎、愤怒的人群和防暴警察的画面应该引起我们的关注。对于美国基督徒来说，他们可能会警告我们不准备面对的未来。我们已经习惯了阅读更多...后政治动荡需要的不仅仅是政治解决方案首先出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/political-turmoil-needs-more-solutions.jpg?resize=1200,628",
