   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "My husband’s serious illness left him weak. But when a physical therapist prescribed exercises to grow strong again, Dan showed little interest. Then one day I did the exercises with him.",
   "summary_zh": "我丈夫的严重疾病使他虚弱。但是，当物理治疗师规定运动要再次变得强壮时， Dan表现出很少的兴趣。然后有一天，我和他一起做了练习。",
   "title_zh": "在基督里的同伴",
