  {
   "title": "Texas Tech law student's famous name has firm’s attorneys recalling inspirational film",
   "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5",
   "category": "lay",
   "source": "Mockingbird",
   "source_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/search",
   "published": "2023-04-07",
   "summary": "Texas Tech law student's famous name has firm’s attorneys recalling inspirational film Lubbock Avalanche-Journal",
   "summary_zh": "德克萨斯理工大学法学院学生的名字让律师回忆起鼓舞人心的电影《拉伯克雪崩》",
   "title_zh": "德克萨斯理工大学法学院学生的名字让公司的律师回忆起鼓舞人心的电影",
   "content": "",
