   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "What blinds us to God’s wisdom in Christ? John Piper opens 1 Corinthians 2:6–13 to show how craving power and acclaim keeps us from seeing Jesus as the Lord of glory. Watch Now",
   "summary_zh": "是什么让我们对神在基督里的智慧视而不见？约翰·派博（ John Piper ）打开哥林多前书2: 6–13 ，向我们展示渴望的力量和赞美是如何阻止我们看到耶稣是荣耀的主。现在观看",
   "title_zh": "世人不能领受的智慧",
   "content": "Wisdom That Leads to Life Wisdom the World Cannot Receive What blinds us to God’s wisdom in Christ? John Piper opens 1 Corinthians 2:6–13 to show how craving power and acclaim keeps us from seeing Jesus as the Lord of glory.",
   "content_zh": "通往生命的智慧世界无法领受的智慧是什么让我们看不到神在基督里的智慧？约翰·派博（ John Piper ）打开哥林多前书2: 6–13 ，向我们展示渴望的力量和赞美是如何阻止我们将耶稣视为荣耀的主。",
