   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "The question is not whether every dispensationalist teaches multiple ways of salvation, but whether the classical system’s division of Scripture and God’s people could consistently avoid that conclusion. Admittedly, most dispensationalists today do not believe that Old Testament believers earned salvation by law-keeping. But that does not settle the historical question: What did the founders...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "问题不在于每个时代论者是否教导多种救赎方式，而在于古典制度对圣经和神子民的划分能否始终如一地避免这一结论。诚然，今天大多数时代论者不相信旧约信徒通过遵守律法来获得救恩。但这并不能解决历史问题：创始人做了什么...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "古典时代主义是否教导了不止一种救赎方式",
