   "published": "2026-11-06",
   "summary": "We all want ourselves, our families, and our churches to shine the light of Christ through our good works. But we will short-circuit that effort if we do so with legalistic, anxious, or fearful hearts. We stepped into the candy shop and could feel it immediately. We were welcome here. And no, it wasn’t...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "我们都希望自己、家人和教会通过我们的善行来照耀基督的光。但是，如果我们用律法主义、焦虑或恐惧的心来做这件事，我们就会缩短这一努力。我们走进糖果店，马上就能感觉到。我们在这里受到欢迎。不，这不是...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "一位糖果店老板、一位海关官员和一个心爱的家庭",
   "content": "We all want ourselves, our families, and our churches to shine the light of Christ through our good works. But we will short-circuit that effort if we do so with legalistic, anxious, or fearful hearts.   We stepped into the candy shop and could feel it immediately. We were welcome here. And no, it wasn’t... Continue Reading",
