  {
   "title": "1 Corinthians 3:10–11: The Foundation Dictates How We Build on It",
   "url": "https://rss.desiringgod.org/link/10732/17517426/the-foundation-dictates-how-we-build-on-it",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Desiring God",
   "source_url": "https://www.desiringgod.org/blog.rss",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "How did Paul see his role as the first preacher a church might hear? He laid the groundwork for generations of faithful preaching. Watch Now",
   "summary_zh": "保罗如何看待他作为教会可能听到的第一位传道人的角色？他为几代人的忠实讲道奠定了基础。现在观看",
   "title_zh": "哥林多前书3 ： 10-11 ：根基决定我们如何在其上建立",
   "content": "John Piper is founder and teacher of Desiring God and chancellor of Bethlehem College and Seminary. For 33 years, he served as pastor of Bethlehem Baptist Church, Minneapolis, Minnesota. He is author of more than 50 books, including Desiring God and The Pleasures of God. Read more about John. John Piper Close John Piper is founder and teacher of Desiring God and chancellor of Bethlehem College and Seminary. For 33 years, he served as pastor of Bethlehem Baptist Church, Minneapolis, Minnesota. He is author of more than 50 books, including Desiring God and The Pleasures of God. Read more about John. More by this author Founder & Teacher, Desiring God",
   "content_zh": "约翰·皮珀是希望上帝的创始人和老师,也是伯利恒学院和神学院的校长. 33年,他担任明尼苏达州明尼阿波利斯的伯利恒浸信会教堂牧师. 他是50多本书的作者,包括\"渴望上帝\"和\"上帝的喜悦\". 更多关于约翰的消息\n\n约翰·皮珀(John Piper Close John Piper)是渴望上帝的创始人和老师,也是伯利恒学院和神学院的校长. 33年,他担任明尼苏达州明尼阿波利斯的伯利恒浸信会教堂牧师. 他是50多本书的作者,包括\"渴望上帝\"和\"上帝的喜悦\". 更多关于约翰的消息 更多作者与老师,",
   "image": "https://dg.imgix.net/resources/17943/media/05c0896e-3c2f-4b85-984e-d2401b03f1cb/landscape/the-foundation-dictates-how-we-build-on-it-en.png?ts=1792435761&ixlib=rails-4.3.1&fit=crop&w=2000&h=1050",
   "author": "John Piper",
   "tags": [],
