   "title": "Report Warns Persecution in Africa ‘Worsened’ as Conflict and Abductions Increased in Nigeria",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/report-warns-persecution-in-africa-worsened-as-conflict-and-abductions-increased-in-nigeria/",
