  {
   "title": "Righteous Before God (feat. James Ritchey)",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/righteous-before-god-feat-james-ritchey/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-07",
   "summary": "Theologians refer to the perfectly righteous life of Jesus as His active obedience. He lived a positively righteous life. We hold that the active obedience of Christ is seen to be ours by faith. This is how we will stand before God. It will not be according to our works or merits. It will all...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "神学家将耶稣完全公义的一生称为他积极的顺服。他过着积极正义的生活。我们认为，因着信心，基督的积极顺服被视为我们的顺服。这就是我们将如何站在神面前。这不会根据我们的作品或优点。一切都会……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "在上帝面前正义（壮举：詹姆斯·里奇）",
   "content": "Theologians refer to the perfectly righteous life of Jesus as His active obedience. He lived a positively righteous life. We hold that the active obedience of Christ is seen to be ours by faith. This is how we will stand before God. It will not be according to our works or merits. It will all... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "神学家将耶稣完全公义的一生称为他积极的顺服。他过着积极正义的生活。我们认为，因着信心，基督的积极顺服被视为我们的顺服。这就是我们将如何站在神面前。这不会根据我们的作品或优点。一切都会……继续阅读",
   "image": "https://1ar.s3.amazonaws.com/2022/07/mountains_landscape_nature_mountain_lake_forest_1200.jpg",
   "author": "James Ritchey",
