  {
   "title": "Don’t Stock the Pantry with Temptation",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/dont-stock-the-pantry-with-temptation/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-07",
   "summary": "We are used to preparing for almost everything. We prepare our clothes, our food, our vacations, and more. Paul is saying that whatever you do, do not prepare to sin. Instead, actively take steps to cut temptation out of your life. Deliberately arrange your life so that sinful desires are harder to satisfy. Avoid certain...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "我们习惯于为几乎所有事情做准备。我们准备衣服、食物、度假等。保罗说，无论你做什么，都不要准备犯罪。相反，要积极采取措施，从生活中消除诱惑。故意安排你的生活，使罪恶的欲望更难满足。避免某些...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "不要让储藏室充满诱惑",
   "content": "We are used to preparing for almost everything. We prepare our clothes, our food, our vacations, and more. Paul is saying that whatever you do, do not prepare to sin. Instead, actively take steps to cut temptation out of your life. Deliberately arrange your life so that sinful desires are harder to satisfy. Avoid certain... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "我们习惯于为几乎所有事情做准备。我们准备衣服、食物、度假等。保罗说，无论你做什么，都不要准备犯罪。相反，要积极采取措施，从生活中消除诱惑。故意安排你的生活，使罪恶的欲望更难满足。避免某些...继续阅读",
   "image": "https://1ar.s3.amazonaws.com/2022/07/mountains_landscape_nature_mountain_lake_forest_1200.jpg",
