   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-07",
   "summary": "Lest we proudly look at the disciples and say, “Ah, but that’s not me,” one author reminds us, “One of the problems with pride is that we can see it in others but not in ourselves” (e.g., Luke 18:9–14).1 We can repeatedly hear God’s words on pride and still fail to see our sin. Instead...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "一位作者提醒我们，免得我们骄傲地看着门徒说： “啊，但那不是我” ， “骄傲的问题之一是我们可以在别人身上看到它，而不是在自己身上看到它” （例如，路加福音18: 9–14 ）。1我们可以反复听到神关于骄傲的话语，但仍然看不到我们的罪。而是……继续阅读",
