   "summary_zh": "通过圣经中这些宝贵的应许，认识神和祂的道路，信徒可以变得像祂一样，逃脱罪（第4节）。我们可以通过了解神的应许并相信祂的应许，来认识祂，并获得过敬虔生活的能力。当我们谈论圣经的充足性时， ……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "圣经的充足性是必不可少的吗？",
   "content": "By knowing God and His ways through these precious promises found in the Bible, believers can become like Him and escape from sin (v.4). We can know God and receive the power to live a godly life by understanding His promises and believing them.      When we talk about the sufficiency of Scripture, what... Continue Reading",
