   "summary": "In the midst of guilt and shame over sin the psalmist turned upward, pleading for mercy, “Out of the depths I cry to you, O LORD! O Lord, hear my voice! Let your ears be attentive to the voice of my pleas for mercy!” (Psalm 130:1-2). Such a cry reflected the blessing the Aaronic priests...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "在罪恶的愧疚和羞愧中，诗人转过身来，恳求怜悯， “耶和华啊，我从深处求告你！主啊，请听我的声音！让你的耳朵注意我恳求怜悯的声音！” （诗篇130: 1-2 ）。这样的呼喊反映了亚伦祭司的祝福...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "充足的赎回",
