   "published": "2026-11-07",
   "summary": "God ensures we will complete our spiritual goals. We will be perfect in Christ one day. We will be complete and lacking in nothing. However, we need the wisdom from above to keep us looking toward that goal amid the trials. However, we often lack that wisdom. Graciously, God implores us to ask Him, and...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "神确保我们将完成我们的属灵目标。我们总有一天会在基督里完美无缺。我们将是完整的，一无所有。然而，我们需要来自上面的智慧，让我们在考验中继续朝着这个目标前进。然而，我们往往缺乏这种智慧。上帝慷慨地恳求我们向祂祈求，并……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "重腿奔跑",
   "content": "God ensures we will complete our spiritual goals. We will be perfect in Christ one day. We will be complete and lacking in nothing. However, we need the wisdom from above to keep us looking toward that goal amid the trials. However, we often lack that wisdom. Graciously, God implores us to ask Him, and... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "神确保我们将完成我们的属灵目标。我们总有一天会在基督里完美无缺。我们将是完整的，一无所有。然而，我们需要来自上面的智慧，让我们在考验中继续朝着这个目标前进。然而，我们往往缺乏这种智慧。上帝慷慨地恳求我们向祂祈求，并……继续阅读",
