   "summary": "Ross-on-Wye is a scenic town in Herefordshire, England. Marked by its high church spire and old market house, a hilltop park provides a stunning view of the nearby River Wye. As you wander Ross’ streets, one name stands out: John Kyrle.",
   "summary_zh": "怀伊河畔罗斯（ Ross-on-Wye ）是英格兰赫里福德郡的一个风景秀丽的小镇。山顶公园以其高高的教堂尖顶和古老的市场房屋为标志，可欣赏附近怀伊河的壮丽景色。当您漫步在罗斯的街道上时，有一个名字脱颖而出：约翰·凯尔（ John Kyrle ）。",
   "title_zh": "丰富的善行",
   "content": "Our Daily Bread Devotionals",
   "content_zh": "我们的每日面包祈祷会",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
