  {
   "title": "Eating Your Own Bread",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/eating-your-own-bread/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-08",
   "summary": "Now those who are such we command and exhort through our Lord Jesus Christ that they work in quietness and eat their own bread. —2 Thessalonians 3:10–12. There is profound wisdom in Paul’s phrase, “eat their own bread.” We change the world not primarily by trying to manage everyone else’s affairs, but by quietly attending...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "现在，我们通过我们的主耶稣基督吩咐和劝勉那些这样的人，他们安静地工作，吃自己的面包。-帖撒罗尼迦后书3:10 –12。保罗的这句话有着深刻的智慧， “吃自己的饼。“我们改变世界的主要方式不是试图管理其他人的事务，而是静静地参加……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "吃自己的面包",
   "content": "Now those who are such we command and exhort through our Lord Jesus Christ that they work in quietness and eat their own bread. —2 Thessalonians 3:10–12. There is profound wisdom in Paul’s phrase, “eat their own bread.” We change the world not primarily by trying to manage everyone else’s affairs, but by quietly attending... Continue Reading",
