   "title": "Living on Purpose",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/living-on-purpose/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-08",
   "summary": "All of us should have regrets. If we are committed to Christ, there will be many things we regret at the end of our lives. We should always regret our sin, the time we wasted, the relationships we neglected, and the worship we took for granted. Walking the path of no regrets is not a...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "我们所有人都应该感到遗憾。如果我们忠于基督，在我们生命的尽头，会有很多遗憾。我们应该永远为自己的罪、浪费的时间、忽视的人际关系和理所当然的崇拜感到遗憾。走在无悔的道路上并不是……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "有目的地生活",
   "content": "All of us should have regrets. If we are committed to Christ, there will be many things we regret at the end of our lives. We should always regret our sin, the time we wasted, the relationships we neglected, and the worship we took for granted. Walking the path of no regrets is not a... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "我们所有人都应该感到遗憾。如果我们忠于基督，在我们生命的尽头，会有很多遗憾。我们应该永远为自己的罪、浪费的时间、忽视的人际关系和理所当然的崇拜感到遗憾。走在无悔的道路上并不是……继续阅读",
