   "title": "The American and Ukrainian Chaplains Traveling to the War’s Frontlines",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/ukraine-war-chaplain-america-frontlines/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Vancouver, Washington, resident Mikhail Pavenko said good-bye to his wife and two young children and boarded his flight to Poland on October 29. On the flight, he shared honestly about his fear: The Ukrainian American would soon arrive at the frontlines of an increasingly deadly war, serving his 10th two-week rotation as a military chaplain  Read more...   The post  The American and Ukrainian Chaplains Traveling to the War’s Frontlines  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "华盛顿的温哥华,居民米哈伊尔·帕文科(Mikhail Pavenko)与妻子和两个年幼的孩子道别后于10月29日登上飞往波兰的航班. 在飞行中,他诚实地分享了他的恐惧:乌克兰裔美国人很快会到达一场日益致命的战争的前线,作为军事牧师的第10个两周轮值. Read more...\n\n在今日基督教上,",
   "title_zh": "前往战争前线的美国和乌克兰牧师",
   "content": "Vancouver, Washington, resident Mikhail Pavenko said good-bye to his wife and two young children and boarded his flight to Poland on October 29. On the flight, he shared honestly about his fear: The Ukrainian American would soon arrive at the frontlines of an increasingly deadly war, serving his 10th two-week rotation as a military chaplain Read more... The post The American and Ukrainian Chaplains Traveling to the War’s Frontlines appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "华盛顿的温哥华,居民米哈伊尔·帕文科(Mikhail Pavenko)与妻子和两个年幼的孩子道别后于10月29日登上飞往波兰的航班. 在飞行中,他诚实地分享了他的恐惧:乌克兰裔美国人很快会到达一场日益致命的战争的前线,作为军事牧师的第10个两周轮值. Read more...\n\n在今日基督教上,",
