  {
   "title": "Q&A: ‘Jimmy’ Director on James Stewart’s Wartime Faith",
   "url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/2026/11/qa-director-aaron-burns-jimmy-stewart-faith/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Christianity Today",
   "source_url": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Most fans of classic Hollywood know Jimmy Stewart. Many don’t realize that the Academy Award winner also served in World War II as a bomber pilot. Or that his postwar struggles drove him to real prayers on the set of It’s a Wonderful Life, helping galvanize his faith as a lifelong Presbyterian. This formative slice  Read more...   The post  Q&A: ‘Jimmy’ Director on James Stewart’s Wartime Faith  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "大多数经典好莱坞粉丝都认识吉米·斯图尔特。许多人没有意识到奥斯卡奖得主也曾在第二次世界大战中担任轰炸机飞行员。或者，他战后的挣扎驱使他在《美好生活》的片场上进行了真正的祈祷，这有助于激发他作为终身长老会的信仰。这个形成性的片段阅读更多...詹姆斯·斯图尔特（ James Stewart ）战时信仰的问答后： “吉米”导演首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "问答：詹姆斯·斯图尔特战时信仰的“吉米”导演",
   "content": "Most fans of classic Hollywood know Jimmy Stewart. Many don’t realize that the Academy Award winner also served in World War II as a bomber pilot. Or that his postwar struggles drove him to real prayers on the set of It’s a Wonderful Life, helping galvanize his faith as a lifelong Presbyterian. This formative slice Read more... The post Q&A: ‘Jimmy’ Director on James Stewart’s Wartime Faith appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "大多数经典好莱坞粉丝都认识吉米·斯图尔特。许多人没有意识到奥斯卡奖得主也曾在第二次世界大战中担任轰炸机飞行员。或者，他战后的挣扎驱使他在《美好生活》的片场上进行了真正的祈祷，这有助于激发他作为终身长老会的信仰。这个形成性的片段阅读更多...詹姆斯·斯图尔特（ James Stewart ）战时信仰的问答后： “吉米”导演首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jimmy-stewart-wartime-faith.jpg?resize=1200,628",
   "author": "Cody Benjamin",
   "tags": [
    "Culture",
    "Cody Benjamin",
    "Faith",
    "Film",
    "Pop Culture",
    "World War II"
   ],
