  {
   "title": "A Disciplined Life",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/11/10/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Tom Cruise has built his film career on a megawatt smile . . . and incredible stunts. The signature stunt in the seventh Mission: Impossible spy action film featured Cruise riding a motorcycle off a cliff and parachuting to safety. In other Mission: Impossible films, he’s hung off an airplane, held his breath underwater for more than six minutes, and performed high-altitude jumps.",
   "summary_zh": "汤姆·克鲁斯（ Tom Cruise ）的电影生涯建立在兆瓦的微笑和令人难以置信的特技之上。第七部《使命：不可能的间谍》动作片的标志性特技是克鲁斯骑着摩托车从悬崖上跳伞到安全地带。在其他任务：不可能的电影中，他悬挂在飞机上，在水下屏住呼吸超过六分钟，并进行了高空跳跃。",
   "title_zh": "有纪律的生活",
   "content": "Tom Cruise has built his film career on a megawatt smile . . . and incredible stunts. The signature stunt in the seventh Mission: Impossible spy action film featured Cruise riding a motorcycle off a cliff and parachuting to safety. In other Mission: Impossible films, he’s hung off an airplane, held his breath underwater for more than six minutes, and performed high-altitude jumps.",
   "content_zh": "汤姆·克鲁斯（ Tom Cruise ）的电影生涯建立在兆瓦的微笑和令人难以置信的特技之上。第七部《使命：不可能的间谍》动作片的标志性特技是克鲁斯骑着摩托车从悬崖上跳伞到安全地带。在其他任务：不可能的电影中，他悬挂在飞机上，在水下屏住呼吸超过六分钟，并进行了高空跳跃。",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
