  {
   "title": "God’s Gift of Wisdom",
   "url": "https://rss.desiringgod.org/link/10732/17518288/gods-gift-of-wisdom",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Desiring God",
   "source_url": "https://www.desiringgod.org/blog.rss",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "What has God’s wisdom planned for his people? John Piper opens 1 Corinthians 2:6–13 to show that God ordained their glory before the ages. Watch Now",
   "summary_zh": "神的智慧为祂的子民计划了什么？约翰·派博（ John Piper ）打开哥林多前书2: 6–13 ，表明神在世世代代之前就设立了他们的荣耀。现在观看",
   "title_zh": "神的智慧恩赐",
   "content": "Wisdom That Leads to Life Part 7 Episode 935 God’s Gift of Wisdom What has God’s wisdom planned for his people? John Piper opens 1 Corinthians 2:6–13 to show that God ordained their glory before the ages.",
   "content_zh": "通向生命的智慧第7部分，第935集神的智慧恩赐神的智慧为祂的子民计划了什么？约翰·派博（ John Piper ）打开哥林多前书2: 6–13 ，表明神在万古之前设立了他们的荣耀。",
   "image": "https://dg.imgix.net/resources/17939/media/5ea0a9ce-040d-4734-ae1d-a8fe7637ac25/landscape/god-s-gift-of-wisdom-en.jpg?ts=1792420684&auto=format%2Ccompress&fit=min&w=1600&h=900&dpr=2&ch=Width%2CDPR",
   "author": "John Piper",
   "tags": [],
   "language": "en",
   "country": "US",
   "region": "",
   "stance": "evangelical",
   "flags": [],
   "priority": 2,
   "fetched_at": "2026-11-11T00:25:57.073503",
