   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "Certainly, the duel between Christianity and atheism remains a primary concern of the world today, with the popularity of Christopher Hitchens, Richard Dawkins, and the New Atheism. And the struggle between individualism and collectivism remains pressing in our modern age, as collectivism has moved from the Soviet Union to New York City’s Gracie Mansion via...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "当然，随着克里斯托弗·希钦斯（ Christopher Hitchens ）、理查德·道金斯（ Richard Dawkins ）和新无神论的流行，基督教和无神论之间的决斗仍然是当今世界主要关注的问题。在我们的现代时代，个人主义和集体主义之间的斗争仍然紧迫，因为集体主义已经从苏联通过……转移到纽约市的格雷西大厦。继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "“耶鲁的上帝和人” ，过去和现在",
   "content": "Certainly, the duel between Christianity and atheism remains a primary concern of the world today, with the popularity of Christopher Hitchens, Richard Dawkins, and the New Atheism. And the struggle between individualism and collectivism remains pressing in our modern age, as collectivism has moved from the Soviet Union to New York City’s Gracie Mansion via... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "当然，随着克里斯托弗·希钦斯（ Christopher Hitchens ）、理查德·道金斯（ Richard Dawkins ）和新无神论的流行，基督教和无神论之间的决斗仍然是当今世界主要关注的问题。在我们的现代时代，个人主义和集体主义之间的斗争仍然紧迫，因为集体主义已经从苏联通过……转移到纽约市的格雷西大厦。继续阅读",
