   "summary": "When you serve in a small church, you realize the blessing of Presbytery for ministers. It is usually the only time you can connect with other ministers in your region. It becomes more than a court or business meeting. It becomes your church where you hear the Word preached, receive the sacraments, and fellowship with...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "当你在一个小教堂里服侍时，你会意识到长老会为牧师带来的祝福。这通常是您唯一可以与您所在地区的其他牧师联系的时间。它不仅仅是法庭或商务会议。它成为你的教会，在那里你听到宣讲的话语，接受圣礼，并与……相交。继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "关于牧养小教会的8个想法",
   "content": "When you serve in a small church, you realize the blessing of Presbytery for ministers. It is usually the only time you can connect with other ministers in your region. It becomes more than a court or business meeting. It becomes your church where you hear the Word preached, receive the sacraments, and fellowship with... Continue Reading",
