   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "We were put in the Garden to work. It is good to work, to struggle, to create, to labor over something for the good of your own sustenance and for the good of your family or community. It is satisfying. I think it’s important for us to find human work, work that only humans can...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "我们被安排在花园里工作。为了自己的生计和家庭或社区的利益，工作、挣扎、创造、为某事而努力是件好事。这是令人满意的。我认为找到只有人类才能找到的人类工作对我们来说很重要...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "人工智能如何将数学家带到传道书",
   "content": "We were put in the Garden to work. It is good to work, to struggle, to create, to labor over something for the good of your own sustenance and for the good of your family or community. It is satisfying. I think it’s important for us to find human work, work that only humans can... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "我们被安排在花园里工作。为了自己的生计和家庭或社区的利益，工作、挣扎、创造、为某事而努力是件好事。这是令人满意的。我认为找到只有人类才能找到的人类工作对我们来说很重要...继续阅读",
