   "title": "How the Book of Ruth Points Us to Christ",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/how-the-book-of-ruth-points-us-to-christ/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "The book of Judges ended by stating the crisis in Israel: There is no king. The book of Ruth shows us how God is working behind the scenes, in the worst of circumstances and with the most unlikely people, to bring into the world a king for his people. The genealogy that begins at the...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "士师记最后指出以色列的危机：没有君王。路得记向我们展示了神如何在最糟糕的情况下，与最不可能的人一起在幕后工作，为祂的子民带来一位王。始于……的家谱继续阅读",
