   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "God can steer Nebuchadnezzar toward wrath, wielding His terrible swift sword against Israel, or toward mercy. The king’s freedom does not put him beyond God’s government. He makes real decisions, but he cannot make himself independent of the Lord who rules his heart. Psalm 106:44–46 describes the same mercy. God hears the cry of His...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "神可以引导尼布甲尼撒走向愤怒，挥舞他可怕的快速剑对抗以色列，或走向怜悯。国王的自由并没有使他超越上帝的政府。他做出真正的决定，但他不能使自己独立于掌管他心灵的主。诗篇106 ： 44–46描述了同样的怜悯。上帝听到他……的呼喊继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "感动国王的慈悲",
   "content": "God can steer Nebuchadnezzar toward wrath, wielding His terrible swift sword against Israel, or toward mercy. The king’s freedom does not put him beyond God’s government. He makes real decisions, but he cannot make himself independent of the Lord who rules his heart. Psalm 106:44–46 describes the same mercy. God hears the cry of His... Continue Reading",
