   "published": "2026-11-10",
   "summary": "At eleven o’clock on a restless night, a young man searches for an answer about why there are so many denominations; the recommendation engine does the rest. The convert-testimony genre promotes the vortex, presenting religious migration as the natural way to resolve one’s discontent. Watch enough of these testimonies and you begin to see a...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "在一个焦躁不安的夜晚的十一点钟，一个年轻人寻找关于为什么有这么多教派的答案；其余的由推荐引擎完成。皈依-见证流派促进了漩涡，将宗教迁徙作为解决不满情绪的自然方式。看够了这些证词，你开始看到……继续阅读",
