   "title": "Inspired by Bible Stories",
   "url": "https://odb.org/2026/11/11/",
   "category": "devotional",
   "source": "Our Daily Bread (English)",
   "source_url": "https://odb.org/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "While reading a book about World War II, I found the story of the Battle for Hill 609 in Northern Africa, in which my dad was severely wounded. I already knew of the event, but as I read a graphic account of what he had gone through that day, I gained a new understanding of him. Is this also what can happen when we read about people in the Bible?",
   "summary_zh": "在读一本关于第二次世界大战的书时，我发现了北非609山战役的故事，在这场战役中，我父亲受了重伤。我已经知道这件事了，但当我读到他那天经历的图片时，我对他有了新的了解。当我们读到圣经中的人物时，这也会发生吗？",
   "title_zh": "受圣经故事启发",
   "content": "While reading a book about World War II, I found the story of the Battle for Hill 609 in Northern Africa, in which my dad was severely wounded. I already knew of the event, but as I read a graphic account of what he had gone through that day, I gained a new understanding of him. Is this also what can happen when we read about people in the Bible?",
   "content_zh": "在读一本关于第二次世界大战的书时，我发现了北非609山战役的故事，在这场战役中，我父亲受了重伤。我已经知道这件事了，但当我读到他那天经历的图片时，我对他有了新的了解。当我们读到圣经中的人物时，这也会发生吗？",
   "image": "https://odb.org/globalassets/global/logos/parent-logos/odb_parentbrand_logo_8-9-24_fullclr_icon.png?width=1200&height=680&rmode=max",
   "author": "Dave Branon",
