   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Deep into Herman Melville’s epic novel about fate and revenge, God and man, whales and whalers, Moby Dick narrator Ishmael shares some advice for writers. “To produce a mighty book,” he says, “you must choose a mighty theme. No great and enduring volume can be written on the flea, though many there be who have  Read more...   The post  ‘The Battle for Heaven and Earth’ Falls Short of Heavenly Aspirations  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "深入赫尔曼·梅尔维尔（ Herman Melville ）关于命运和复仇、上帝和人类、鲸鱼和捕鲸者的史诗小说，《白鲸记》（ Moby Dick ）的叙述者伊斯梅尔（ Ishmael ）向作家们分享了一些建议。“为了制作一本强大的书，”他说， “你必须选择一个强大的主题。跳蚤上不可能写出伟大而持久的体积，尽管有很多人已经阅读更多……《天地之战》这篇文章首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "title_zh": "《天地之战》缺少天心",
   "content": "Deep into Herman Melville’s epic novel about fate and revenge, God and man, whales and whalers, Moby Dick narrator Ishmael shares some advice for writers. “To produce a mighty book,” he says, “you must choose a mighty theme. No great and enduring volume can be written on the flea, though many there be who have Read more... The post ‘The Battle for Heaven and Earth’ Falls Short of Heavenly Aspirations appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "深入赫尔曼·梅尔维尔（ Herman Melville ）关于命运和复仇、上帝和人类、鲸鱼和捕鲸者的史诗小说，《白鲸记》（ Moby Dick ）的叙述者伊斯梅尔（ Ishmael ）向作家们分享了一些建议。“为了制作一本强大的书，”他说， “你必须选择一个强大的主题。跳蚤上不可能写出伟大而持久的体积，尽管有很多人已经阅读更多……《天地之战》这篇文章首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
   "image": "https://www.christianitytoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/battle-for-heaven-earth.jpg?resize=1200,628",
