   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "I was writing this critical review of The Impossible Teachings of Jesus when I stopped to imagine its author, Andrew Farley, approaching me for a conversation. He is clutching a manuscript in his hand, a question on his mind. “I heard that you don’t like my book. Is my theology inaccurate?” “No, your theology seems  Read more...   The post  Complex Theology Expressed in Marketing Lingo Is a Match Made in Hell  appeared first on  Christianity Today .",
   "summary_zh": "我写了一篇关于耶稣不可能的教义的批判性评论, 当时我停止想象着它的作者安德鲁·法利(Andrew Farley)接近我谈话。 他手头上拿着一个手稿,这是他心中的一个问题。 \" 我听说你不喜欢我的书。 “不,你的神学似乎更...\n\n在「今日基督教」上,",
   "title_zh": "营销术语中表达的复杂神学是地狱制造的匹配",
   "content": "I was writing this critical review of The Impossible Teachings of Jesus when I stopped to imagine its author, Andrew Farley, approaching me for a conversation. He is clutching a manuscript in his hand, a question on his mind. “I heard that you don’t like my book. Is my theology inaccurate?” “No, your theology seems Read more... The post Complex Theology Expressed in Marketing Lingo Is a Match Made in Hell appeared first on Christianity Today .",
   "content_zh": "我正在撰写这篇对《耶稣不可能的教训》的批评性评论，当时我停下来想象其作者安德鲁·法利（ Andrew Farley ）走近我进行对话。他手里拿着一份手稿，脑子里在想一个问题。“我听说你不喜欢我的书。我的神学是否不准确？“不，你的神学似乎阅读更多……《市场营销中表达的复杂神学》一文首次出现在《今日基督教》上。",
