   "summary": "“While I was in heaven, I encountered the Jesus who desired relationship above all else. When you understand this, you will know how such evil and horrible things have happened on the earth. It has nothing to do with God’s will—it results from our disobedience and choices to rebel against Love Himself. God is only...  Continue Reading",
