   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "All the signs of trouble were there. How did Tyndale miss them? Perhaps he was too hopeful. Perhaps he was tired of having his guard up, and wanted to believe that Phillips really was a genuine friend. Jesus taught us to beware of “the sons of this world [who] are more shrewd” (Luke 16:8) compared...  Continue Reading",
