   "title": "Why the Reformation Still Matters For Everyday Life",
   "url": "https://theaquilareport.com/why-the-reformation-still-matters-for-everyday-life/",
   "category": "giant",
   "source": "The Aquila Report",
   "source_url": "https://theaquilareport.com/feed/",
   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "Even good things can become misplaced sources of security when we begin to rely on them rather than Christ. Solus Christus reminds us that Jesus alone is our mediator and that His work on the cross is sufficient for our salvation. We cannot add to what He has accomplished, nor can anything else take His...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "当我们开始依赖好东西而不是基督时，即使是好东西也可能成为错误的安全来源。梭罗·基督提醒我们，只有耶稣是我们的中保，祂在十字架上的工作足以拯救我们。我们不能增加他所取得的成就，其他任何东西也不能带走他的……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "为什么宗教改革对日常生活仍然很重要",
   "content": "Even good things can become misplaced sources of security when we begin to rely on them rather than Christ. Solus Christus reminds us that Jesus alone is our mediator and that His work on the cross is sufficient for our salvation. We cannot add to what He has accomplished, nor can anything else take His... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "当我们开始依赖好东西而不是基督时，即使是好东西也可能成为错误的安全来源。梭罗·基督提醒我们，只有耶稣是我们的中保，祂在十字架上的工作足以拯救我们。我们不能增加他所取得的成就，其他任何东西也不能带走他的……继续阅读",
