   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "The PCUSA ordained its first female pastor in 1956, leading to its culture of egalitarianism, and eventually, non-restrictive policies about sexuality. Recently, the denomination has gone so far as to debate whether pastors must be monogamous. Both the liberal Episcopal and United Methodists have likewise established cultures where female ordination is also typical. As a...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "美国长老会于1956年任命了第一位女牧师，这导致了其平等主义文化，并最终导致了对性行为的非限制性政策。最近，这个教派甚至争论牧师是否必须是一夫一妻制的。自由派圣公会和联合卫理公会都建立了同样的文化，其中女性按立也是典型的。作为……继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "“独自合格的人”",
