   "published": "2026-11-11",
   "summary": "A pastor friend told me that the first cure for one’s selfishness is marriage, and the second cure is having children. I wonder how many couples God could have sanctified more deeply if they had sought to adopt a child, not just a cat or a dog. By the way, we have 16 kitties in our...  Continue Reading",
   "summary_zh": "一位牧师朋友告诉我，自私的第一个疗法是婚姻，第二个疗法是生孩子。我想知道，如果有多少对夫妇试图收养一个孩子，而不仅仅是一只猫或一只狗，上帝本可以更深刻地使他们成圣。顺便说一句，我们有16只小猫...继续阅读",
   "title_zh": "将收养作为一种选择",
   "content": "A pastor friend told me that the first cure for one’s selfishness is marriage, and the second cure is having children. I wonder how many couples God could have sanctified more deeply if they had sought to adopt a child, not just a cat or a dog. By the way, we have 16 kitties in our... Continue Reading",
   "content_zh": "一位牧师朋友告诉我，自私的第一个疗法是婚姻，第二个疗法是生孩子。我想知道，如果有多少对夫妇试图收养一个孩子，而不仅仅是一只猫或一只狗，上帝本可以更深刻地使他们成圣。顺便说一句，我们有16只小猫...继续阅读",
